<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Luke</book>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="mt">Luke</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka it Theophilus awng: Mihing tam mama in eite sungah thupiangte amate ii thiam thei za tekin at zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kipat panin a mute le a thu a thangsakte ii hong son bang teng veu ma at uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahiciang hi thute a kipat pan a, pha takpi in ka et thiang uh ahikom, a kipialcian in na heak natu in, phamaw hi ci in kong at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang tungah hong kihil a thute, a maan le a cingin na heak natu in kong at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judea ngam ah Herod Kumpipa a maan laitakin, Zechariah a kici thiampi khat om a, ama sia thiampi Abijah ii pawlkhen sungah a kihel thiampi khat ahi hi. A zi min Elizabeth hi a, ama zongh thiampi suan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate ngeal Pathian mai ah ngamtatna phate taw a nungtate hi a, Topa ii thukham le thupiaknate a zuite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in ta a nei bua uh hi, banghang ziam cile Elizabeth sia ta nei thei ngawl a, Zechariah taw amate ngeal huai mama khawm zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni khat Zechariah sia Biakinn sungah a thiampi nasep seam a, ni sim biakpiakna hunzeakna sungah ama ii hun hong tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thiampite ngeina om bangin, ama biaknatau tungah ngimnamtui hal tu in, aisaanna taw a kiteal ahi hi. Tua ahikom Topa Biakinn sungah tum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mipite in ngimnamtui hal hunsung theampo doipua panin thungen in ngak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa vantunglalang khat ama kungah hong kilangh a, ngimnamtui halna biaknatau ii ziatsang ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zechariah in ama a mu ciangin, patau in lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang vantunglalang in hi bangin ci hi, “Zechariah awng, lau heak in! Pathian in na thungetna hong za zo a, na zi Elizabeth in tapa khat hong hin pui tu hi. A min John ci in na phuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangza ta in na lungdam in na thinnuam tu ziam? Midang tam mamate zongh ama hong sua ciangin, bangzata in lungdam tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama Topa muna ah mi thupi khat hong hi tu hi. Ama in sapittui le zu ne ngawlin a om kul tu hi. A nu ngilsung pan kipan ama Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciangin ama in Israel mite tam mama amate Topa Pathian kungah zotpui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in kamsaangpa Elijah bangin, vaangletna le thahatna taw Topa mai ah paikhol tu hi. Ama in pate le tate hong ngawmtua kik tu hi, thu ni ngawl mihingte thutang ngaisut theina sungah hong kiheisak kik tu a, Topa atu a kivawt khol mihingte a pian natu in seam tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zechariah in vantunglalang tungah, “Tu a na son teng thutak hi ci in koibang tel thei tu khi ziam? Kei le pasal huai hi zo a, ka zi zongh huai zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vantunglalang in zo kik a, “Kei sia Gabriel ka hi hi. Pathian omna munah a om pa ka hi a, hi lungdamna thupha, nang kungah hong puak tu le nang taw kipaupui tu in, hong kisawlpa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang kong thupuakte um ngawl ni hi, hikale a hun hong tun tak ciang, ka ci bangin hong piang tu a, hong um ngawl na hikom, na pau thei nawn buatu hi. Kong thuciam teng a tun mateng in, pau thei nawn ngawl dide tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun sung teng mipite in doipua panin ngak top uh a, Biakinn sungah ama ngei mama hun a zak hu in, lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hong pusua kik tak ciangin, ama pau thei nawn ngawl hi, tua ahikom, Biakinn sungah ama in mukholna mu hi ci in he uh hi. Kammal khat zongh huthe thei nawn ngawl ahikom khut taw lim lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biakinn sungah nasep tu teng a man zawkciangin, Zechariah a inn ah cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawk tawmvei ciangin, a zi Elizabeth naungil om a, tha nga sung puapial nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tu peetma ciang ahile Topa in hong hu zo hi, ngual mai ah ka maizumna teng ama in hong vawksak zo hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elizabeth naungil a om zawk tha luk a cin ciangin vantunglalang Gabriel sia Galilee ngam Nazareth a kici khua khat ah Pathian in paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa David suan Joseph a kici khat taw kiteang tu in kiciamna a vawtsa ngaknu khat kungah, thupuak tu in a kisawl ahi hi. Ngaknu nu ii min Mary ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vantunglalang in ama kungah pai in, “Thinnopna na nga ta in! Topa sia nang taw hong omkhawm a, nasia takin thupha hong pia hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mary sia vantunglalang ii thupuak huvau in, thinngim mama a, ama kammalte ii khiaknate ngaisusun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vantunglalang in, “Mary awng, lau heak in. Nang tungah Pathian hong thuthiam mama zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nangma in nau na paai tu a, a sua ciang a min Jesus ci in na phuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama hong thupi tu a, a Saang Bel Pathian ii Tapa kici tu hi. Topa Pathian in a taanghpupi David bangma in kumpipa suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaciangin ama Jacob ii suan, a tawntung a maang kumpi hong hi tu a, ama ii ngam bo hun nei ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mary in vantunglalang tungah, “Keima in, ngaknu thiangtho ka hi hi, koi bangin tu a na son bangin suak thei tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vantunglalang in, “Nang tungah Thaa Thiangtho hong om tu a, Pathian ii vaangletna in nang hong uap tu hi. Hi thu hu in, patang thiangtho sia Pathian Tapa kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na bee nu Elizabeth ngaisun ka po in, ngual in ama tasel tu in a see sa hi, ahizong a huai mama kawm panin, tu in naungil a om zawk tha luk pha zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in na khat beak vawt mawk a nei bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Kei sia Topa naseamnu khi hi, hong ci babangin, kei tungah hong tung tahen,” Mary in a ci zawkciang vantunglalang in nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua zawk hiat ciangin Mary kithoai cingtengin Judea ngam mualtung khua khat ah manlang takin pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in Zechariah inn sungah tum in Elizabeth biakpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mary biapuina aw a zaak ciangin Elizabeth sung a om nauno lungdam in kisaan hi. Elizabeth Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />aw nging tak taw hi bangin ci hi. “Nang sia numei a minpiang thupha a saangbel nu na hi hi, na hin tu nauno in, thupha nga tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka Topa ii nu takpi kei kung a hong haw natu dongin, banghangin hi bangza a thupi thu hong piang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Banghangin tuabangin ci khi ziam cile nong paupuina aw ka zaak po ciang, ka sung a nauno lungdam in kilawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Topa ii hong thupuakte hong piang tatak tu ci a, na up thei hu in, bangza ta in mi lungdam na hi ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mary in, “Ka thin ka lung in Topa pok hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian ka Ngumpa hangin ka thaa lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama in kei a kithusim ngawl a naseamnu hong phawk hi. Tu a kipan mihingte in, thupha saang nu hi hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Vaanglian Pathian in kei tungah nasep lian hong sep hu ahi hi. Ama min thiangtho hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />khang khat pan khang khat, Ama a patoaite tungah hesuakna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A thahatna baan hong vaan a, a kiphasakte le tuabang mihingte tupnate mangtatamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ama in kumpi liante a tokhum uh panin khiasuk a, a niamte laamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A ngilkialte neakpha taw vaak a, a haute khut hawm nguak taw taisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ama in ih taanghpupite tungah a thuciamte kholet a, a naseam ahi Israel hu tu in hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ama in Abraham tungah hesuakna a piak tu in a ciam sate, a suan a paal theampo tung dong ah piak tu in, a tawntungin phawk hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Mary tha thum bang Elizabeth kungah a taam zawkciang cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Elizabeth a nau sua tu hun hong cing a, tapa khat hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Topa ama tungah thuthiam mama hi ci in a innpaamte le a mealheakte in za uh a, lungdam pui tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Nausen nipi khat a phak ciangin, a vunteap attansak tu in, hong pai uh a, a pa min la in, “Zechariah” ci in phuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ahihang a nu in, “Hi ngawl hi! A min John hi tu hi.’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“No phung sungah min tuabang om ngawl hi,” a ngualte in ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin a pa tungah bang min phuak tu hi ziam ci in lim taw dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Zechariah in lai atna thingpheak ngen a, “A min John hi,” ci in at hi. Amate in lamdang sa mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tua hun lian laitakin, Zechariah hong pau thei kik a, Pathian pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />A innpaamte patau siat a, tuaciang hi thute Judea ngam mualtung tengah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A zate theampo in, “Hi nausen bangbang mi hong suak tu ziam,” ci in ngaisutna le thudokna sia a thinsung tek ah om hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii vaang ama tungah om hi, ci in thiangtel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />John ii pa Zechariah Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim a, tuaciang ama in Pathian kam a saan teng son a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Israel te ii Pathian Topa pok tek tawng! Ama in a mite hun tu in hong pai a, suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Ama in a vaanglian Hunpa khat hong pia a, a naseampa David ii suan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Taanghlai in a kamsaang thiangthote tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />ih ngalte le hong ensante theampo ii thahatna pan hong hun tu in hong kamciam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Ama in ih taanghpupite tungah hesuakna hong lak tu in, hong ciam zo a, ama thuciam thiangtho phawk kik tu in hong khaam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Ih taanghpupi Abraham tungah a ciliap huai kamciam taw ih ngalte khut sung panin hong hut zawk natu le ngammuangin ama ii na seam tu in hong kamciam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama mai ah ih nuntak lai theampo a thiangtho le thutang in, ih om thei natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Nang, ka tapa, a Saang Bel Pathian kamsaangpa hi hong kici tu hi. Nang in Topa mai ah na paikhol tu a, a lampi na sialsak khol tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Ama mihingte tungah mawna kimaisakna taw ngupna piang tu hi, ci in na son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Ih Pathian sia hesuak thiam a, thinneam hi. Ama in ngupna zing khuavak ei tungah hong taangsak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />tuaciangin thina khuazing limh sung a teangte theampo tungah vantung panin hong taang tu a, thinnopna lampi tung, ih kalsuanna ah hong lampui tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Nausen sia pumpi le thaa sungah hong khangto hi. Ama Israel mipite mai ah a kilak hun dong sennealngam sungah teang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Augustus Kumpilianpa in Rome Kumpi ngamlian sung bup mihing kisimna omsak tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi a masa phitbel mihing kisimna a kivawt hun laitakin Quirinius sia Syria ngam ngamuk mangpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom mihing simin amate khua tek ah min khum tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joseph zongh Galilee ngam Nazareth khua panin Judea ngam Bethlehem khua, David Kumpipa suana munah hong pai hi. Joseph tua khua ah hong pai theina thu sia, ama in David ii suan ahihang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama taw a kiteang tu dokzu a kipiasa ahi Mary taw min khum khawm tu in pai uh hi. Ama naungil omsa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem khua ah a taam sungin, a nausua tu hun cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tapaciil suak a, zin tun natu zinbuk awng nawn ngawl ahikom, puan taw a nau tunin khui ankuang sungah sial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ngam ah tuucing pawlkhat om a, zan lai in a tuute cingin duisung ah ngiak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vantunglalang khat amate kungah kilangh a, tuaciang Topa vaang amate tungah taang hi. Amate lau mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong vantunglalang in, amate munah, “Lau heak vun. Mihing theampo atu, a lungdamhuai mama, lungdamna thupha no tungah puak tu in kong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni mama in David khua ah note hong Hunpa — Christ Topa suak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thumaan a hina na tel natu in, nausen khat puan taw kituun in, khui ankuang sungah kisial na mu tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thakhat thu in, vantunglalang honpi tua vantunglalang ii kungah kilangh a, Pathian pokna lasa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Van a saangbelna ah Pathian minthang tahen, ama ii dik a sak leitung mihingte tungah thinnopna om tahen!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vantunglalangte van ah a cia kik zawk uh ciangin, tuucingte khat le khat hi bangin kici uh hi, “Eite Bethlehem khua ah pai in, Topa hong sonsa thupiang sia en tawng,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang amate manlangin pai uh a, Mary, Joseph le khui ankuang sungah nausen kisial mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuucingte in ama a mu uh ciangin nausen huvau vantunglalang ii sonsa teng son kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A za theampo in tuucingte son thute lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mary in hi thute a vekpi in ciamtee a, thuk takin khuangaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuucingte zongh cia kik a, amate ii mu le a zaak thute hu in Pathian pokna lasa uh hi; vantunglalang ii son bang tatak ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nipi khat zawkciangin, nausen ii vunteap at tu hun hong theng a, ama ii naungil om ma in, vantunglalang ii piaksa min ahi Jesus ma phuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses Thukham ii thupiak bangin Joseph le Mary te ii a kithiansua natu hun hong theng hi. Tua ahikom amate in patangno sia Topa tungah aap tu in Jerusalem ah paipui hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa thukham sungah: “Tapa suakciil peuma Topa atu in ki aap tu hi,” ci in ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa thukham sungah a om bangma in, amate in ngam vakhu kop khat ahibuale inn vakhu moi nii taw sangaw biakpiakna vawt tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Jerusalem khua ah Simeon kici pasal khat om hi. Ama sia mihing pha Pathian kiita pa hi a, Israel te a kingup tu ngakin a om khat ahi hi. Thaa Thiangtho sia ama taw om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa ii a ciamsa Messiah a mu mateng a thi ngawl natu in, thinmuanna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho in lampui a, Simeon Biakinn sungah tum hi. A nu le a pa in patangno Jesus sia thukham zeksa teng vawt tu in, Biakinn sungah a paipui uh ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Simeon in patang toai in, Pathian tungah lungdamko hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tu in Topa awng, nong kamciamna na kholet zo a, na naseampa thinnuam takin, hong lawnsak thei tu na hi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka mittang mama taw nong tatna ka mu zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tua thu mihing theampo ii mu thei tu in na vawtkhol zo hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gentile te tungah na deina a kipualaak natu le na minam Israel mite tungah minthanna a puak khuavak khat na hi hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Patang ii pa le nu in hi bangin Simeon ii a thuson a zaak uh ciangin lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Simeon in amate thupha a piak zawkciangin, a nu Mary tungah hi bangin ci hi, “Hi patang sia Israel mite, tam mama ii a siatcip natu le, tam mama ii a kingup natu Pathian ii tealsa ahi hi. Ama sia mihing tam mama ii a langpan tu, Pathian ii lim lakna khat hi tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuaciangin tua mihingte thinsung thuku theampo kipualaak tu hi. Tuaciang khuangaina in, namsau hiam khat bangin, nangma thin mama hong tamhsak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asher suan Phanuel ii tanu Anna a kici nupi meingong huai mama kamsaangnu khat om hi. Ama kum sali sung bek a pasal in nuntak pui a, tu in a kum sawmliat le kum li pha zo hi. Ama in Biakinn nusia ngeingawl a, sun taw zan taw Pathian bia in an tangin thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua hun laitak ma in, ama hong theng a, Pathian tungah lungdam a ko zawkciang, Jerusalem a suatak tu Pathian a ngakte theampo tungah patangno ii thu son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Joseph le Mary in Topa Thukham zeksate a sep tu teng a sep zawkciang Galilee ngam Nazareth khua a inn uh zuan kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Patang hong khang a hong hat hi; ama ciimna taw kidim a, tuaciangin ama tungah Pathian thupha om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesus ii nu le pa sia Paisan Poai siim tu in, kum simin Jerusalem ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesus kum sawm le kum nii a phak ciangin, a pai ngei uh bangma poai siim tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Poai man ciangin inn ah cia kik tu in amate pai uh a, ahizong patangno Jesus sia Jerusalem ah taam hi. A nu le a pate in a he bua uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />amate in mihon sungah a om ma in ngaisun ahikom ni khat bup a pai zawk uh ciang a lawmte le a mealheakte kawm tengah zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amate in Jesus mu ngawl ahikom Jerusalem ah heak kikin zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A ni thum ni ciangin biakinn sungah Jew syate taw tokhawm a thu ngai thu dongh in a om mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama ii ciim kammal taw a zona te a za theampo in lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A nu le a pa in ama a mu uh ciangin lamdang sa in, a nu in a tapa ii munah, “Ka tapa awng, banghangin hi bangin hong vawt ni ziam? Na pa le kei in, nang kong zawzonna in ka thin uh ngim mama hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ama in zo kik a, “Banghangin kei hong zong nu ziam? Ka pa inn sungah ka om tu a kul hunlam he ngawl nu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ahizong a nu le a pa in ama zo kikna thu a tel bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus amate taw Nazareth ah heak kik a, tua munah amate thu ni in om hi. A nu in hi thute theampo a thinsung ah keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesus sia a pumpi le ciimna ah hong khangto a, Pathian le mihingte tung panin maipha nga hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hun sia Kumpilianpa Tiberius ii a maan zawk kum sawm le kum nga a cin hun hi a; Pontius Pilate sia Judea ngamuk mangpa hi in, Herod sia Galilee ngamukpa hi a, a suapuipa Philip sia Iturea ngamkhen le Trachonitis ngamukpa hi; Lysanias sia Abilene ngamukpa hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang Annas le Caiaphas sia thiampi lianbelte ahi uh hi. Tua hun laitakin sennealngam sungah a om Zechariah ii tapa John tungah Pathian kammal hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom John in Jordan Ngundung ngamkuam bup ah thuhil a, “Na mawna uh kisiik kik vun a, tui kiphum vun, tua hile Pathian in na mawna uh hong maisak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Isaiah laibu sungah a ki at bangma in: “Sennealngam sungah mihing khat hong au a: ‘Topa atu lampi sialkhol vun; ama khualhaw natu in lamzin tang khat vawtsak vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngamkuam theampo kivuk tu a, Muallian le mualnote theampo kiziik tam tu hi. Lam kingkoai theampo kimam in, Lam ham theampo a neal in kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minam theampo in Pathian ii ngupna mu tu hi,’ ci hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihonpite sia John ii tuiphum tu in, hong pai tek uh hi. Amate tungah, “No ngul honte awng, Pathian ii hong tunsak tu daan pan, suakta thei tu nu hi ci in akua in no hong son ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mawna uh pan na kisiik kikna uh kilanghsak vun. Tuaciangin Abraham sia kote ii taanghpupi hi ci in, noma tetek sungah na kici tuan heak vun. Kei kong cina pan, Pathian in suangtum hite zongh la in, Abraham suan le paal in vawt thei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thingkungte phuk tu in a bul ah, hei mai kingat zo hi; nga pha a nga ngawl thingkung theampo kiphuk tu a, meimang sungah kisep tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipite in, “Tua hile bangbang a ngamta tu khu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Laktong silh nii a neite in, a nei ngawlte silh khat hawm tahen, an a nei te zongh in tuabang ma in hawm tahen,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Shiadong pawlkhat zongh tui kiphum tu in hong pai a, “Sya awng, ko zongh bangbang ka ngamta tu uh ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na khon tu uh sangin a tamzaw khon heak vun,” amate tungah ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngalkap pawlkhat in, “Ko zongh bangbang a ngamta tu khu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. Amate tungah, “Zawthawk thu taw kuama tung pan sum la heak vun, leilot thu taw kuama tungah thu zong heak vun. Na thasum uh taw lungkim vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihingte ii lametna sia khang tu in kipan a, amate in John sia Messiah ahi ka tawm maw ci in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom John in amate tungah, “Kei ka hile tui taw tui kong phum hi, ahihang kei sangin a lian zaw pek khat hong pai lai tu hi. Ama ii peangdap khau suut tu zongh in ka kilawm bua hi. Ama in Thaa Thiangtho le meikuang taw hong baptize tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in ankheap natu taangkheaplaw, a khut sungah toai zo hi, zungtaangte hong kheap tu a, a tang teng saal sungah khawmtua in; a theap teng a mit ngeingawl meikuang sungah hal tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />John in Lungdamna Thupha mipite tungah a nanam in hil a, amate tek ii nuntakna ziate a kikheal thei natu in hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahizong John in ngamuk mangpa Herod teih hi, banghang ziam cile ama in a suapuipa ii zi Herodias teenpui a, phat ngawlna zongh tam ma vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang Herod in John sia thong sungah a khumna taw in ngamtatna a sia seseam khat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing a om theampo tui a kiphum zawk uh ciangin, Jesus zongh tui kiphum hi. A thunget laitak van kihong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho sia a kimu thei pumpi taw ngam vakhu bangin a tungah hong tu hi. Tuaciang aw khat van panin hong nging a, “Nang sia ka it ka Tapa na hi hi. Nang tungah ka lungkim hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesus naseam tu in hong kipat laitakin ama kum kum sawmthum bang pha zo hi. Ama Joseph ii tapa hi ci in mihingte in ngaisun uh a, Heli ii tapa Joseph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Matthat ii tapa Heli, Levi ii tapa Matthat, Melchi ii tapa Levi, Jannai ii tapa Melchi, Joseph ii tapa Jannai
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mattathias ii tapa Joseph, Amos ii tapa Mattathias, Nahum ii tapa Amos, Esli ii tapa Nahum, Naggai ii tapa Esli,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maath ii tapa Naggai, Mattathias ii tapa Maath, Semein ii tapa Mattathias, Josech ii tapa Semein, Joda ii tapa Josech,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joanan ii tapa Joda, Rhesa ii tapa Joanan, Zerubbabel ii tapa Rhesa, Shealtiel ii tapa Zerubbabel, Neri ii tapa Shealtiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Melchi ii tapa Neri, Addi ii tapa Melchi, Cosam ii tapa Addi, Elmadam ii tapa Cosam, Er ii tapa Elmadam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joshua ii tapa Er, Eliezer ii tapa Joshua, Jorim ii tapa Eliezer, Matthat ii tapa Jorim, Levi ii tapa Matthat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Simeon ii tapa Levi, Judah ii tapa Simeon, Joseph ii tapa Judah, Jonam ii tapa Joseph, Eliakim ii tapa Jonam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Melea ii tapa Eliakim, Menna ii tapa Melea, Mattatha ii tapa Menna, Nathan ii tapa Mattatha, David ii tapa Nathan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesse ii tapa David, Obed ii tapa Jesse, Boaz ii tapa Obed, Salmon ii tapa Boaz, Nahshon ii tapa Salmon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amminadab ii tapa Nahshon, Admin ii tapa Amminadab, Arni ii tapa Admin, Hezron ii tapa Arni, Perez ii tapa Hezron, Judah ii tapa Perez,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jacob ii tapa Judah, Isaac ii tapa Jacob, Abraham ii tapa Isaac, Terah ii tapa Abraham, Nahor ii tapa Terah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Serug ii tapa Nahor, Reu ii tapa Serug, Peleg ii tapa Reu, Eber ii tapa Peleg, Shelah ii tapa Eber,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cainan ii tapa Shelah, Arphaxad ii tapa Cainan, Shem ii tapa Arphaxad, Noah ii tapa Shem, Lamech ii tapa Noah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Methuselah ii tapa Lamech, Enoch ii tapa Methuselah, Jared ii tapa Enoch, Mahalaleel ii tapa Jared, Kenan ii tapa Mahalaleel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Enosh ii tapa Kenan, Seth ii tapa Enosh, Adam ii tapa Seth, Pathian ii tapa Adam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan ngun panin, Jesus sia Thaa Thiangtho taw kidim in, hong heak kik a, tua Thaa in senneal ngamsung dong lampui in paisak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua munah Doaimangpa in ni sawmli ze et hi. Tua hun sung teng theampo bangma neak nei ngawl ahikom, tua hun a bo ciangin a ngilkial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Doaimangpa in “Pathian Tapa na hi le, suang hi sia anluum a sua natu in thupia in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong Jesus in, “Mihingte sia anluum bek taw nungta thei hi ngawl hi, ci in Laithiangtho sungah ki at hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Doaimangpa in ama la to a, thakhat thu in leitung ngam theampo lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hi vaangletna le hi hauna theampo kong pia tu hi. Hite theampo keima khut sung a hong ki aapsa hi a, ka piak nop po ii tungah ka pia thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei hong bia lete hite theampo nangma ii neisa suak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesus in “Laithiangtho in na Topa Pathian bek na bia tu a, ama atu bekma na seam tu hi ci hi!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Doaimangpa in ama Jerusalem ah paipui a, Biakinn khuvum a saangbelna ah suanhto in, ama tungah, “Pathian Tapa na hile hi sung panin nangma le nangma kilawn suk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, ‘Pathian in nang hong keam tu in, a vantunglalangte sawl tu hi,’ laithiangtho in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Amate in a khut uh taw hong domto tu a, na peang beak zongh suang taw a kithutha buatu hi,’ ci lai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong Jesus in, “Laithiangtho in, ‘Na Topa Pathian na ze et heak in’ ci hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Doaimangpa in Jesus a nanam in a ze et zawkciang, tawm vei sung nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Jesus Galilee ngam ah heak kik a, tuaciangin Thaa Thiangtho vaangletna sia, ama taw omkhawm hi. Ngamkhen sung bup ah, ama thu hong thang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in synagogue sungah hilna nei a, a kuama po in pok hon uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang in Jesus Nazareth khua ama khanna munah cia kik a, Sabbath ni in synagogue ah a pai ngei bangin pai hi. Ama dingin Laithiangtho sim tu in kithoai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuaciangin kamsaang Isaiah ii laibu aap uh hi. Laizial phel a, hi bang a ki atna mun mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Topa ii Thaa kei tungah hong om hi, banghang ziam cile mizawngte tungah lungdamna thupha puak tu in kei hong teal hi. A kimante suatakna a pia tu le, mittawte khua a mu kik natu, nencip a thuakte suatakna thu a thangsak tu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in amate a ngup natu hun hong theng zo hi, ci in thangsak tu in kei hong kisawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus in laizial zialin, a keampa tungah a aap kik zawkciang ama to hi. Synagogue sungah a to theampo in, ama lamdang et tek uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hi laithiangtho kammal hong kisim teng na zaak uh bangin, tuni in hi thu teng hong taangtung zo hi,” a ci hu in, lamdang et tek ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kammal taknei taw a pau thiam hu in mihingte thinsung hong suu hi. “Ama sia, Joseph ii tapa hi kana ngawl ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate munah, “ ‘Syavuan pa awng, nangma le nangma kidamsak phot in,’ ci paunak sia kei tungah hong zangh tu ci in kong up nginge ma ahi hi. Tua bek dom ngawlin, Capernaum khua ah a kivawt na zaak uhte hi lai ka khua zongh ah vawtin hong sawl lai tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tatakin kong ci ciang, kamsaangte sia, amate khua ah kisaang ngeingawl hi,” Jesus in ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Hong ngai tavun: Elijah hun sung kum thum le kum lang nguatui kang a, ngam bup kialpi a tun laitakin Israel ngam sungah meingong tam mama om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahitazong Elijah sia Israel ngam sungah meingongte khat beak ii kungah a kipaisak bua hi, ahihang Sidon ngamkhen Zarephath khua ah teang meingong khat ii kungah, kipaisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciangin kamsaangpa Elisha hun ciangin Israel ngam sungah a lauhuai vun natna vei tam mama om hi; ahitazong Syria mi Naaman simngawl khat beak zongh a kidamsak bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Synagogue sung om mihingte in, hi thu a zaak uh ciang thin uuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate dingin Jesus khua pua sangah kai a, a khuamual liang tung pan lotsuk sawmin paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang ama mihonte kaantan in paisuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Jesus Galilee ngam Capernaum khua ah pai a, Sabbath ni in mihingte tungah thuhil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama thuhil zia lamdang sa uh hi, banghang ziam cile ama in thuneina taw pau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Synagogue sungah doai ngilo khat ii thaa a vei pasal khat om a, ama in nging takin ciik au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Aw Nazareth mi Jesus awng, ko bang hong law nuam ni ziam? Hong susiacip tu in hong pai ni ziam? Nang akua ci in hong he khu hi; nang sia Pathian ii a thiangtho kamtaipa ni hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesus in thaa tungah thupia a, “Thim in, pasalpa sung pan pusuak in!” ci hi. Doai in mihingpa sia amate mai ah lei denna in nei a, bangma dang tatsak ngawlin a sung pan pusuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mihing theampo in lamdang sa uh a, khat le khat hi bangin kici uh hi. “Tu a kammalte bangbang kammal ziam? Thuneina le vaangletna taw hisia pa in, thaa ngilote thupia a, tuaciang amate pusuak hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesus huvau thu kipuakte, tua ngamsung mun theampo ah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesus in synagogue nusia in Simon inn ah pai hi. Simon sunghnu a cisa in suk a, amate in Jesus munah tua thu son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama lupna ah Jesus pai in, ciina nu kungah ding a, ciina nu ciisuk natna pan a dam natu in thupia hi. A ciisuk hong thai a, thakhatin tho in, amate zindo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ni a tum zawkciangin, natna satna a tuatuam a veite peuma a lawmte in Jesus kungah hong paipui uh hi; mihing sim tungah a khut nga a, damsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mipite sung panin, doaite pusuak a, “Nang sia Pathian Tapa na hi hi,” ci in au uh hi. Jesus in doaite a pau ngawl natu thupia hi, banghang ziam cile ama sia Messiah ahi hunlam doaite in he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khua hong vak ciangin, Jesus in khuapi nusia in, a ngamkhingna mun khat zuan hi. Mipite in, ama zong tu in kipan uh a, a mu ciangin, a taam lai natu in tho uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahihang, amate tungah, “Pathian Ngam huvau, Lungdamna Thupha sia khuapi dangte zongh ah, ka hil kul tu hi, banghang ziam cile tua nasep seam tu ma in, Pathian ii hong sawlpa ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in, ama in ngam bup sung synagogue te ah thuhil hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat Jesus Gennesaret Tuili hui ah dingin mipite in Pathian thu ngai tu in, ama sangah neak ngawp nuamin a kiphulung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ngunkuang nii vaalbo tungah kikaito sa in a om mu hi; ngasa paaite in a ngeen uh a sil laanin, a nusiat uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngunkuangte sung pan khat sia Simon aa hi a — Jesus in tua tungah kaa in — vaalbo panin tawm a khualana ah sawnin sawl hi. Jesus ngunkuang tungah to in, mihonte hilna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A son tu teng a man zawkciangin, Simon munah, “Na ngunkuang tui thukna munah sawn lai in, tuaciang in nang le na seppuite ngasa man tu in na ngeen uh hong khiasuk tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simon in, “Topa awng, zan khuateakin ka diang zo uh a, bangma man ngawl khu hi. Ahihang nangma in hong sawl na hi ciang, ngeente ka khiasuk tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a khiaksuk uh ciangin, ngasa tam mama man a, a ngeente ektham dektak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin ngunkuang dang khat sung pan a seppuite, amate hu tu in sam uh hi. Amate hong pai a, ngunkuangte ngeal dimin, ngasa a sun uh ciangin, a ngunkuangte tui sungah tum dektak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Simon Peter in bang thu teng piang, ci in a mu ciangin, Jesus mai ah, ama khupdin in, “Topa awng, kei kung pan kiheam in! Kei sia mimawpa khi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama le a ompui dangte in, ngasa tam mama a mat uh sia lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simon seppui ahi Zebedee tate James le John zongh in, lamdang sa uh hi. Jesus in Simon tungah, “Lau heak in; tu pan kipan mihingte na man tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in a ngunkuang uh vaalbo tungah kaito a, a neisa theampo nusia in, Jesus nung zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khatvei Jesus khuapi khat sungah om a, tua munah, a lauhuai vun natna a vei pasal khat om hi. Ama in Jesus a mu ciangin, a mai ah bok a, “Topa, nong thiangthosak nuam le hong thiangthosak thei ni hi,” ci in thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesus in a khut vaan a, ama tham in, “Hong thiangthosak nuam khi hi. Thiangtho ta'n!” ci hi. A natna teng thakhatin dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in, “Kuama munah son heak in, ahizong thiampipa kungah pai paih ta'n a, ama in vealsak ta'n; tua zawkciang, a kuama theampo in dam zo hi, ci in hong heak natu in, Moses ii sawl bangin, sangaw biakpiaknate vawt ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus ii thu thang seseam a, tuaciang mihonpite in ama thuson ngai tu le, a natnate pan damna a nga tek natu in, a kungah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus a ngamkhingna munte ah thungen tu veu in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni khat Jesus ii a thuhil laitak, Galilee ngam, Judea le Jerusalem panin Phariseete pawlkhat le, Thukham hil syate to hon uh hi. Ciinate a damsak natu in, Topa vaangletna Jesus tungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in pumzaw khat, a lupna taw zawng a, inn sung Jesus mai ah tumpui tu in hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahizong mihonte hangin a tumpui natu, lampi a mu zo bua uh hi. Tua ahikom amate in ciina sia innkhum tungah puato in, suangpheak pawlkhat a lokkeak zawk uh ciang, mihonte laizang Jesus mai ah a lupna taw ma in khiasuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua mite in bangza in upna nei ci, Jesus in a mu zawkciang pasalpa tungah, “Na mawna hong kimaisak zo hi, lawm awng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thukham hil syate le Phariseete in, “Pathian zawnsakna kampau hisia pa akua ziam! Mawna maisak thei sia, Pathian khat simngawl a dang om ngawl hi,” amate tetek kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesus in amate ii ngaisutna teng he ahikom hi bangin ci hi. “Banghangin tuabangin ngaisun nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Na mawna hong kimaisak zo hi,’ ci sia le ‘Tho in a lampai in,’ ci sia koisia ol zaw ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom mihing Tapa in, leitung ah mawnate maisak theina thu a nei hunlam kong lak tu hi,” ci hi. Tua zawkciangin pumzaw pasalpa munah, “Tho in, na lupna luak in a, inn ah cia ta'n, hong ci khi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thakhat thu in, amate mai ah pasalpa tho a, lupna luakin, Pathian min pokna taw inn ah cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate theampo in lamdang tatak sa uh hi. Launa taw kidim in, Pathian pok kawm a, “Tuni in, bangza in a tumdang nate mu thong hi ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus pusuak a, Levi kici shiadongpa a zum sungah to in a om mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus in ama tungah, “Hong zui ta'n,” ci hi. Levi zongh dingin na theampo nusia in zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Levi in ama inn ah, Jesus atu in anvaakna poai lian khat vawt a, a leangnate sungah shiadongte tam ma le midangte kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pharisee pawlkhat le tuate sung pan Thukham hil syate in Jesus nungzuite tungah lungkim ngawlna hi bangin ci uh hi. “Banghangin shiadongte le a kipuavawkte taw annekhawm tuidawn khawmin om nu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesus in, “Mihing ciidamte in syavuan a kitaangsamh bua hi, ciinate bek in kitaangsamh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A zatakhuai mihingte a kisiik natu a sam tu in kong pai bua a, a kipuavawkte a sam tu in kong pai hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in Jesus tungah, “John ii nungzuite sia an tang mun mama in thungen hi, tuabang ma in, Phariseete ii nungzuite zongh in, ngamta uh hi; ahihang na nungzuite in anne tuidawn in om uh hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesus in, “Mopoai sungah zineipa a om laiteng, leangnate an kidan thei na ziam? Kidan thei ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahihang zineipa amate kung pan a kilaak zawkciangin amate in an a tang tu uh hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesus in hi thusonteena sia zongh amate tungah son thua hi. “Kuama in puan thak khat leapin, puan luisa phawna in nei ngeingawl hi. Tuabang hile, puan thak sia lalsak a, puan lui sia zongh a phawna taw kilawm ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Savun thawl luisa sungah kuama in sapittui thak thaal ngeingawl hi, banghang ziam cile sapittui thak in savun thawl lui sia saantham tu a, sapittui bua in, savun thawl lal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua sangin sapittui thakte sia savun thawl thak sungah kithaal zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaciangin sapittui kumlui a dawn sate in sapittui thak a du buatu hi, ‘A lui sia phazaw hi,’ ci hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath ni khat, Jesus in zungtaang lote kaantan in pai hi. A nungzuite in zungtaang huite hiat uh a, a tangte ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharisee pawlkhatte in, “Sabbath ni a, vawt thei ngawl tu hi ci in, Thukham ii a cite banghangin vawt nu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“David le a ngalkapte a ngilkial uh ciangin, a ngamtatna uhte sim ngeingawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Pathian inn sungah tumin, Pathian a kipiasa anluum la in, ne a, a lawmte zongh pia hi, a tatakin ci leang tuate thiampite ngawl po ii neak thei natu ngeina om ngawl hi,” ci in Jesus in amate zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in a thukhupna ah, “Mihing Tapa sia Sabbath ii Topa ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sabbath nidang khat ah Jesus synagogue ah pai a, thuhil hi. A khut ziatsang a zaw pasal khat tua munah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thukham hil syate le Phariseete in Jesus tungah mawna zong nuamin, Sabbath ni in ciina a damsak ziam a damsak bua ziam, ci in a khial tu encik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in amate thinsung he siat ahikom pasalpa tungah “Ding in a, hi sung mai sangah hong pai ta'n,” ci hi. Pasalpa tho a, dingto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in tua mite tungah, “Ih Thukham in Sabbath ni in bang teng sep tu hong oai ziam? ci in hong dongh khi hi. Ngual huzaw tu hi ziam maw? Ngual nasak zaw tu hi ziam? Mihing khat ii nuntakna huu zaw tu hi ziam maw susia zaw tu hi ziam?” ci in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a kiim a om theampo a et zawkciang; pasalpa tungah, “Na khut vaan in,” ci hi. Tuabangin ahiciang a khut dam kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate a thin uuk mama a, Jesus bang law thei tu hi ziam, ci in kikum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Jesus, mual tungah kaato in, zankhuateak Pathian tungah thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuavak ciangin, a nungzuite ama kungah sam a, amate sung pan nungzui tu sawm le niite teal hi, tuate sawltakte kici hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Simon (Peter ci in min vaw hi) le a suapuipa Andrew; James le John, Philip le Bartholomew,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Matthew le Thomas, Alphaeus ii tapa James le Simon (minam it a kici pa),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />James ii tapa Judas le ama a leeheakpa, Judas Iscariot ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mualtung pan sawltakte taw Jesus hong tuaksuk kik ciangin, zaanglei tam mun khat ah a nungzui mihing honkhat taw ding hi. Judea ngam bup pan le Jerusalem le tuipi hui khuapi Tyre le Sidon pan, hong kingawmtua mihon khat, tua munah om uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate in Jesus thuhilna ngai tu le a natna uh pan a damsak tu thangai in hong pai ahi uh hi. Thaa ngilote ii vawtsiat mihingte zongh hong pai a, dam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing theampo in ama tham tu in, hanciam uh hi, banghang ziam cile ama tung panin, vaang hong pusuak a, amate damsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzuite en a, “No a zawngte in a lungdam te na hi uh hi. Pathian Ngam sia note aa ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tu laitak a ngilkialte in a lungdamte na hi uh hi; na ngil uh a va tu hi! “Tu laitak a kapte in a lungdamte na hi uh hi; na nui tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa hangin ngual in hong ensan a, hong nial in hong lang in, misiate awng hong cile, a lungdamte na hi uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabangin thu hong pian ciangin lungdam vun a, lawpna taw na diang vun, banghang ziam cile no atu vantung ah thaman lian khat kikoisak hi. Banghang ziam cile amate ii taanghpupite zongh in kamsaangte tungah tuabang ma in, na ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ahizong tu laitak no a haute atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam; no sia a nuam a nungta sa hi zo nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu laitak no a ngilvate atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam; na ngil uh kial tu hi! “Tu laitak no a nuite atu bangza in lauhuai ziam; tau in na kap tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mihingte in hong phat son ciangin bangza in lauhuai ziam; amate taanghpupite zongh in leilot kamsaangte, tuabang ma in na son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ahizong hong zate tungah kong ci hi: Na ngalte it vun, hong ensante tungah thupha vawt vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />hong haamsiatte tungah thupha pia vun a, hong vawtsiate atu thungetsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khat po in na biang lang hong beang le, a lang zongh na beang thuasak vun; khat po in na laktong puasilh a la le, na laktong zongh na pia thua vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bang khat pawpo hong ngen a om le na pia vun, na neisa uh hong laaksak a om le, na ngen kik heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Noma tungah hong kivawt le na oai uh bangin, ngual tungah na vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“No hong itte bek na it uh le, banghangin thupha saang tu nu ziam? Mimawte zongh in amate a itte it hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaciang in no tungah thupha hong vawtte tung bek ah thupha vawt le uhte, banghangin thupha khat saang tu nu ziam? Mimawte ngawngawn zongh in tuabang ma in ngamta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hong lo kik tu a na muanmawk uhte tung bek ah na pukthaak uh le, bangbangin thupha khat saang tu nu ziam? Kilo kik tu lam etna taw mimaw tetek zongh kipukthaak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuabang hi ngawl hi! Na ngalte it vun, amate tungah thupha vawt vun; sum pukthaak tavun a lo kik tu na thangai heak vun. Tua hile no in thaman lian khat na nga tu uh a, a Saang Bel Pathian ii tate na suak tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile ama sia lungdamna a he thei ngawlte le mihing ngilote tungah thuthiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na Pa uh sia hesuak thiampa ahi bangma in, no zongh ngual na hesuak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ngual tungah thu na khen heak vun, tua hile Pathian in no tungah thu hong khen ngawl tu hi, ngual na mawsak heak vun, tua hile Pathian in hong mawsak ngawl tu hi; Ngual mawna na maisak vun, tua hile Pathian in note mawna hong maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ngual na piak uh bangin, Pathian in hong pia tu hi. Ngual na piakna uh taw kizui in a kihen ikek a kilok cinten, a teena khum a vuum a dimleet in Pathian in no tungah hong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in hi thusonteena son hi: “Mittaw khat in mittaw dangkhat lam a pui thei buatu hi; tuabangin lampui le a nii in dum sungah taak khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sangpatangpa in a syapa sangin, lianzaw ngawl hi; sangpatang peuma a sin tu teng a man zawkciangin, a syapa bang hong hi pheang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Banghangin na suapuipa mittang sung a ninteak sia mu thei in nangma mittang sungah thingluang sia thupi laak thei ngawl ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Na suapuipa munah, ‘Suapui awng nong hesuakna in, na mittang sungah ninteak sia hong laakkeaksak tong,’ na ci hang, nangma mittang sung a thingluang sia zongh mu thei ngawl hi ngawl ni ziam? No a kihitheamsakte awng! A masa phit in noma mittang sung a thingluang sia lakeak phot vun, tuasia zawkciangin na suapuipa mittang sung pan ninteak sia na laak thei natu in, a thiang takin, na mu thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Thingkung ciidam khat in thingnga pha ngawl a nga bua a, tuaciang thingkung pha ngawl khat in thingnga pha a nga bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thingkung sim in a nga taw in a kung ii omzia kitel thei hi; Ngam lingkung tung panin theinga na lo bua uh a; lingkung tung panin sapitnga na lo bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Miphapa in, a thinsung ah a kholsa phatnate panin, thuphate pusua a; mihing pha ngawl pa in thusiate pusua hi. Banghang ziam cile thinsung ah a dimin a om bangin kam panin kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Banghangin ‘Topa, Topa’ hong cici napi, kong son bang vawt ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mihing khat po in, kei kungah hong pai in, ka kammal hong ngai a, ka thu hong nite sia bang taw kibang ziam cisia kong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama sia inn sapa khat khuamkua a thuk in to a, suangpi sia inn doppha in a nei pa taw kibang hi. Namthuam a, tua inn nawkngawp ahihang pha takin kisa ahikom a ngawk zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahizong ka thu hong ngai a, ka sawl bangin hong ni ngawlte sia inn doppha a nei ngawl inn sa pa taw kibang hi; namthuam in a nawk ciangin tua inn thakhat thu in puk a — bangzata in a lauhuai lalthapna ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in mihingte tungah hi teng a ci zawkciang, Capernaum khua ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah Rome ngalkap hon ukpa ii a it mama a naseampa khat om a; ama thi dektakin a cina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa in Jesus thu a zaak ciang, a naseampa a damsak nop manin Jesus sam tu in Jew upate pawlkhat paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Jesus kung a thet ciangin, “Hisia pa hu lete kilawm mama ka sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in ih mite hong it a, synagogue khat zongh ko atu in hong saksak hi,” ci in nasia takin thuumsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus sia ama a samte taw paikhawm hi. A inn nai hong thet uh ciangin, ngalkap hon ukpa in a lawmte paikholsak a, hi bangin Jesus tungah cisak hi, “Topa awng, ngim nga thong tu ni hi. Kei inn sungah nang nong pai tu sia ka kiphu bua hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />nang kungah kei kong pai tu hang zong kilawm kisa ngawl khi hi. Thupia po lete, ka naseampa dam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima zongh thunei uliante khutnuai ah naseam khat ka hi a, keima ii khutnuai zongh ah ngalkapte om hi. Khat ii munah, ‘Pai in!’ ka cile, pai a; ‘Hong pai ta'n!’ ka cile, hong pai hi. Ka sila pa munah, ‘Hisia vawt in!’ ka ci ciang zong, ama in vawt hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesus in hi thu teng a zaak ciangin, lamdang sa hi; a nung pan a zui mihingte sangah kingeilee in, “Hi bang upna Israel mite sung ngawngawn zongh ah ka mu ngei bua hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamtaite ngalkap hon ukpa inn ah cia kik a, a naseampa a damsa in mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawk tawmvei ciangin Jesus in Nain a kici khua khat ah a nungzuite le mihon khat taw kithawlin pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuapi kongpi a thet lian laitakin mihing pawlkhat thaan kuan tu in hong pusuak hi. Mithipa sia meingong khat ii khat bek a nei sun tapa hi a, khua sung panin mihon in meingongnu zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in ama a mu ciangin hesuakna thin taw kidim a, “Kap heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Jesus in mithi luang kung zuanin tham a, a kuang puate in din uh hi, Jesus in, “Tangval awng! Tho in kong ci hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mithi pa hong tho to a, pau tu in a kithoai ciang Jesus in, a nu aap kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate theampo lau in, Pathian pok uh hi. “A lian mama kamsaangpa khat ei sungah piang zo hi! Pathian in a mite ngum tu in hong pai zo hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi bang Jesus ii thusia ngamsung le a kiimkot ngamkhente ah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />John ii nungzuite in hi thu teng John tungah a son uh ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama in mihing niite Topa tungah hi bangin thu dongh tu in paisak hi. “Nang sia John ii hong pai tu hi a cisia ma na hi ziam? tua ahibuale ngualdang ka na lam en lai tu uh ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in Jesus kung hong thet uh ciangin, “Nang sia hong pai tu pa tatak na hi na ziam? Tua ahibuale mihing dangkhat ka lam en lai tu uh ziam? ci in Tuiphumpa John in nangma kungah dongh tu in ko hong paisak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun laitak mama in Jesus in, mihing tam mama te ii a natnate uh pan le, thaa ngilo veina uh panin damsak a, mittawte tam ma khua musak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in John ii kamtaite tungah, “John kungah heak kik tavun a, na mu uh na zaak uh teng son tavun: mittawte in khuamu a, peangbaite pha tak lampai thei a, a lauhuai vun natna veite kidamsak a, nangongte in khuaza a, mithite kitho kiksak a, a zawngte tungah Lungdamna Thupha kihil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei hong muangla ngawlte bangza in a lungdamte ahi uh ziam!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />John ii kamtaite in a nusiat zawk uh ciang, Jesus in John ii thu, mihonte tungah son tu in kipan hi: “John ii thuhilna ngai tu in, sennealngam sungah na pai uh ciangin, bang mu tu in na kimuangmaw uh ziam? Vui ii khulup lopate ziam? A bangbel en tu in pai nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bang en tu in pusuak nu ziam? Puan hoi nawno silh pasal khat ziam? Tuabang a kizeam a, a nuamin a nungtate sia kumpi teenna innte bek ah om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hong son tavun, bang en tu in pusuak nu ziam? Kamsaangpa khat ahi ziam? Hi hi, ahizong no ii mu sia kamsaang khat sangin lianzaw pek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile John sia laithiangtho sungah: ‘Pathian in na lampi hong honkholsak tu in, kamtai khat na mai ah ka na puak tu hi’ a ci sia ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus in, “A tatakin ka ci ciang John sia mihing a, a minpiang khat pawpo sangin, lianzaw hi. Ahihang Pathian Ngam sungah a nobel pa in, John sangin lianzaw hi,” ci in belap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihing theampo in ama thu za uh hi; amate a tuan in shiadongte in Pathian ii dei thumaan thutangte saang thei in John in tuiphum zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang Phariseete le thukham hil syate in amate atu, Pathian ii tupna te nial in, John ii tuiphum tu a uuk bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesus in a kampau zomto suak a, “Tu hun a mihingte bang taw hong teengat tu khi ziam? Amate bang taw kibang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate vanh zuakna phual ah, a to patangte taw kibang hi. Pawlkhat in a dang pawlkhatte ausan a, ‘Mopoai la hong sak ung, ahihang laam nuam bua uh teh! mithi vuina la hong sak ung, ahizong kap nuam bua uh teh!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuiphumpa John hong pai in, ama in an tang a, sapittui ne ngawlin a om ciangin ‘doaivei hi!’ ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihing Tapa hong pai a, ama in ne in dawn in, a om leleau ciangin, ‘En vun. Antuangpa, zutuangpa, shiadongte le a kipuavawkte ii lawmpa!’ ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahitazong, Pathian ciimna a saang theite theampo atu in, thumaan hi ci in kilak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pharisee khat in Jesus an ne tu in sam a, Jesus in tua pa inn ah pai in, an ne tu in to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua khuapi sungah mawneinu khat teang hi. Jesus sia Pharisee pa inn ah an ne hi, ci in a zaak ciangin sathau namtui suangngo thawl khat dim hong paipui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesus ii nungsang a peang hui ah dingin, kap in a thitui taw Jesus ii peang kawtsak hi. Tua zawkciang a sam taw Jesus peangte nawlin, a peangte namh a, tuate tungah paaknamtui buak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pharisee pa in a mu ciangin, “Hisia pa sia kamsaang hi takpi le ama a tham numei hisia akua hi ci in he tu a, bangbang mawna taw nungta cisia he tu hi!” ama le ama kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesus in, “Simon awng, kong son tu thu khat om hi,” ci hi. “Hi hi, syapa awng, hong son ta'n” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesus in, “Sum pukthaak khat pa tungah leiba mihing nii om hi. Khat in dangkatang za nga ama tungah ba a, a khat sia in sawmnga ba hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A nii ma in, lo kik zo ngawl ahikom, ama in amate ngeal ii leibatte maisak hi. Tua ahile, a koisia zaw in ama a it zaw tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Ka upmawk in, a tamzaw a kimaisak sia in it zaw tu hi,” Simon in ci in zo hi. “Na ci bang maan hi,” Jesus in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Numeinu sangah nga in Simon tungah hi bangin ci hi, “Hi numei na mu ziam? Na inn sungah kong tum a, ka peang sil natu tuidam takpi zong nong pia bua hi, ahihang hisia nu in a thitui taw ka peang hong silsak a, a sam taw hong nawlkosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang in napna taw nong muak bua hi. Ahihang hisia nu in kong thet pan kipan ka peang hong namh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ka lu ah ka thii tu olive thau nong pia bua hi, ahihang hisia nu in paaknamtui taw ka peangte hong noisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kei kong ci in a, ama ii, itna lianpi hong lakna sia in, ama mawna tam mamate kimaisak zo hi, ci na thu kiciansak hi. Tua hi a, tawm bek a kimaisakte in itna tawm bek lak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in numei nu munah “Na mawnate kimaisak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Sabuai ah a to dangte in, “Mawnate ngawngawn a maisak hisia akua ziam,” amate sung tengah ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in, numeinu munah, “Na upna in hong ngum zo hi; thinnuam in va pai ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawk tawmvei zawkciang, Jesus sia khuapi le khuanote ah, khualhaw in Pathian Ngam huvau Lungdamna Thupha hil hi. Nungzui sawm le niite in zui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuabang ma in numei pawlkhat le amate sung panin, thaa ngilo veina le natna satna dang a damsakte, Mary (Magdalene a kici), ama ii sung pan doai sali a nawkeaksak nu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Herod ii zumsung ulian khat ahi Chuza ii zi Joanna; le Susanna le a dang numei tam mama, Jesus le a nungzuite hu natu in, amate neisun po a pia pawlkhat in kitholpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua khat panin khua khat ah mihingte in Jesus kungah hong pai uh hi; mihon tam mama hong kikhop zawkciang, Jesus in hi thusonteena son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Khatvei lai in, pasal khat in thaicii poai tu in kuan hi. Lo sungah thaicii a poai ciangin, thaicii pawlkhat lamzin tungah taak a, tua munah kisiikcip in vacimte in tawm khawng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawlkhat suang tamna munah tu a, a kung hong po tak ciang ngawtaakcip hi, banghang ziam cile, tua mun lei a nol bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thaicii pawlkhat lingkung sungah tu a, tua lingkung taw khangkhawm in, lingkung in deapcip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang thaicii pawlkhat leiphana ah tu hi; a kung po a, a kung simin a zaa zakhat tek nga hi.” Tuaciang Jesus in a thuson khup a, “Bil nei po in hi thu za tavun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nungzuite in Jesus tungah hi thusonteena ii khiakna dongh uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama ii a zo kikna pan, “Pathian ngam thu thuthukte heakna no tungah hong kipia zo hi. Ahizong ngualdang a tu in, sonteena taw kipia hi, amate in en napi in a mu thei ngawl, ngai napi in a tel thei ngawl natu in kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Thusonteena ii khiakna in hi bang ahi hi: thaicii sia Pathian kammal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lamzin tungah a tu thaiciite sia a thu a zate hi; ahihang Doaimangpa hong pai a, ngupna a nga ngawl natu le a up ngawl natu in, a thinsung uh pan tua Pathian thu sia laaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Suang tamna munah thaicii a tute sia Pathian thu lungdam takin za a, a saangte hi. Ahizong a thu in thuk bun ngawl hi; tawmvei hunsung teng um phot ahihang, ze etna hong pai ciangin, amate puk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ling kawm ah thaicii a tute sia a thu za a, ahizong thinngimna, hau nopna le leitung nopsaknate in khunel a, amate min hun a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leiphana ah a tu thaiciite sia a thu za a, thunitna thinsung pha taw keamcing a, a ngate a nga dong a zomto suakte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kuama in meiinn vaakin kuang taw khup ahizong, tua ahibuale lupna nuai ah ahizong koi ngeingawl hi. Hong sungtangte ii mu thei tu in, meivakna khuam tungah vaak zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A kiseal nate theampo a kilangh in kipusua tu a, a kikhupsin theampo kimu tu a, kipualaak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua ahiciang na thu zaak uhte kidawm tavun; banghang ziam cile a neite tungah tamzaw kipia tu a, a nei ngawlte tung panin, nei a kisak tawmnote ngawngawn zongh kilaaksak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesus ii nu le a suapuipate ama kungah pai uh a, ahizong mipite hangin ama taw a kisi thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus munah khat in, “Na nu le na suapuipate inn pua ah ding a, nang taw kimu nuam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesus in amate theampo munah “Ka nu le ka suapuipate sia Pathian thu za a, a zuite ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni khat Jesus in a nungzuite taw ngunkuang sungah to uh a, “Tuili ngalkhat ah pai tawng,” ci hi. Tuabang ma in kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate tuabangin tui tungah a pai laitak, Jesus mutthip hi. Thakhat thu in tuili tungah suangval hong vasuk a, ngunkuang sungah tuicing tu in kithoai ahikom, amate atu in lauhuai mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nungzuite in Jesus kung pai in phong a, “Topa, Topa! Ei teng thi dektak zo hing!” ci uh hi. Jesus tho in vuipi le tuihualte thupia a, tuate thimin, dai dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang nungzuite munah, “Na upna uh koisung om ziam,” ci hi. Ahihang amate in lamdang sa in lau uh a, khat le khat hi bangin kici uh hi. “Hisia pa akua ziam? Ama in vuipi suangval le tui kihualte tungah thu a piak ciangin tuate in, a thu ni uh hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesus le a nungzuite tui tungah paisuak uh hi. Galilee tuili ngal Gerasa ngamkhen theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesus vaalbo ah a kaa ciangin, tua khua mi doaivei khat in muak hi. Tuasia pa khuangeipi hun sung puansilh ngawlin om a, inn ah om nuam ngawlin thaan hawng sungah teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in Jesus a mu ciangin nasia takin au a, a peang kungah kileiden in, “A saangbel Pathian Tapa Jesus awng! Kei bang hong law nuam ni ziam? Daan nong piak ngawl natu hong thum khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi bangin a ci thei sia banghang ziam cile, Jesus in thaa ngilo munah, ama sung pan a pusua natu thupia zo ahihang hi. Tamvei mama thaa ngilo in ama man a, ama thong sungah a khut le a peangte thikkol bulin a kikhum hang, a thikkolte saantat in, sennealngam sungah doai in not hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesus in, “Na min bang ziam,” ci in dongh hi. “Ka min sia ‘Mihonpi’ ahi hi,” ci hi — banghang ziam cile ama sungah doai tam mama tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua doaite in Jesus munah, a hawng thukpui sungah a puak ngawl natu in thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua taw a kinaina mualpangh ah, vok honkhat an zongin taa uh hi. Doaite in Jesus munah tua vokte sungah a tumsak natu in, ngen uh a, Jesus thukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in pasalpa sung pan pusuak a, vokte sungah tum uh hi. Vok hon bup sia mualpangh liang pan kinuntaw suk a, tuili sungah tuitaa in thi siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Vokcingte in thupiang teng mu ahikom amate tai in, khuapi sung le lote ah a thu thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mihingte in bang thupiang ziam ci in, en tu in Jesus kungah hong pai uh ciang, ama sung pan, doai a kinawkeaksak sia pa, puansilh sa in, thinciim takin, Jesus peang kungah to hi; tuasia ciangin amate lau siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua thupiangte a mute in ngualdangte munah tuasia pa sia bangbangin kidamsak ci thu son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ngam ah mihing theampo in, Jesus sia mundang a zot natu in, sawl uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate lau mama uh hi. Tua ahikom Jesus in ngunkuang tungah kaa in ding kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A sung pan doai a nawkeaksak pa in, “Hong zuisak ta'n,” ci in Jesus munah thuum hi. Ahihang Jesus in heak kiksak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Na inn ah cia kik ta'n, Pathian ii nang tungah na hong sepnate son ta'n,” ci hi. Pasalpa zongh in, khua sung kaantan in pai a, Jesus ii ama tungah a nasep teng son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesus sia tuili langkhat ah hong heak kik ciangin mite in muak uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in ama ngak in om top zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Jairus kici mihing khat hong theng hi; ama sia tua munah a om synagogue ulian khat ahi hi. Ama in Jesus peang ah bok a, a inn ah a haw natu in thuum hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />banghang ziam cile kum sawm le kum nii a pha khat bek a nei a tanu sia thi dektak hi. Jesus taw hong tonkhawm a, a kiimkot panin mihonpite in phultha tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuate sungah kum sawm le kum nii chibua top numei khat kihel hi; syavuan thapna in a nei a lamh theampo zangh siat zo hi, ahihang kuama in a damsak zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite sung, Jesus ii nungsang pan hong pai a, a puanmong tham hi. Thakhatin a chibua sia thai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jesus in, “Akua in hong tham nu ziam,” ci hi. Amate in nial tek uh hi. Peter in, “Mipite in na kiimkot panin hong neak tek hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahizong Jesus in, “Hong tham khat om hi, banghang ziam cile ka pum sung panin, vaangletna a pusua hunlam ka he hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Numeinu in ama kiphawk zo ci in a heak ciangin liing ngawpin pai a, Jesus peang ah bok hi. Tua munah a om mihing theampo ii muna ah ama ii puanmong a thamsakna thu le, thakhatin a kidamsakna thu son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jesus in ama tungah, “Ka tanu awng, na upna in hong damsak zo hi, Thin nuam takin, va pai ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesus in hi bang teng a pau laitakin, ulianpa inn pan kamtai khat hong pai a, Jairus munah, “Na tanu thi zo hi. Topa ngim pia nawn heak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in tua thu za a, Jairus munah, “Thintoi heak in; um po in, ama dam tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua inn a thet ciangin ama in Peter, John, James le numeino ii nu le pa simngawl a dang teng a sungtan tu a oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualai ah a om theampo in numeino hu in kap in mau in om uh hi. Jesus in, “Kap heak vun; numeino thi ngawl hi — a mu hi bek hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amate in Jesus nuisan uh hi, banghang ziam cile numeino thi zo hi ci in he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in numeino ii khut pan kaito in, “Ka tano awng, tho in!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Numeino hong nungta kikin, thakhat thu ama hong tho to a, tuaciang Jesus in a neak tu bangkhat po a piak natu in a kiim a om mite sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A pa le a nu in nasia takin lamdang sa uh hi, ahihang Jesus in thupiang teng kuama tung a son ngawl natu in khaam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzui sawm le niite sam a doai naw natu le ciinate damsak natu in, vaangletna le thuneina pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Pathian Ngam thuhil tu le ciinate damsak tu in amate paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate tungah hi bang teng ci masa hi, “Na khualhaw natu ah bangma keng heak vun; ciangkhut ahizong, sum ngetna ip ahizong, an ahizong, sum ahizong, puan laih natu ahizong, keng heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hong kisaang na inn pawpo ah tung vun a, tua khua na nusiat uh dong tua inn ah taam tavun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />no hong kisaang ngawlna mun khuate peuma nusia vun a, a kidop thei natu in na peang leivuite na thin tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nungzuite kuan in khuano theampo kaantan in pai a, Lungdamna Thupha hil in, mun theampo ah ciinate damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Galilee ngamukpa Herod in, thupiang theampo a zaak ciangin, a lungmang mama hi, banghang ziam cile mihing pawlkhat in, tuiphumpa John hong nungta kik hi ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawlkhat in Elijah hong kilangh zo hi a ci om a, pawlkhat in taanghlai a kamsaang khat hong tho kik hi ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Herod in, “John ii ngawng tansak zo khi hi; ama thu huvau ka zaak sia akuabel hi tu ziam?” ci hi. Tua zawkciangin ama in, Jesus a mu thethei natu in hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sawltakte hong cia kik uh a, amate sep sa theampo Jesus tungah ko uh hi. Ama in amate paipui in, Bethsaida a kici khuapi zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihonte in tua thu a zaak uh ciangin, ama zui uh hi. Ama in tua mite pha takin saang a, Pathian Ngam thuhil in, a kisamh te damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitum kuan ciangin, nungzuite sawm le nii ama kungah hong pai a, “Mipite khuano sungah ahizong, lo sungah ahizong, an le ngiabuk zong tu in paisak in, banghang ziam cile hi lai mun sia a tongta mama mun khat ahi hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in, “Amate neak tu, bang khat pawpo noma mama in pia vun,” ci hi. Amate in “Ka nei theampo uh a kingawm anluum nga le ngasa nii hi bek hi. Hi mihon bup atu an lei tu in pai le ung hong oai ni ziam?” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />(Pasalte tulnga bang pha hi). Jesus in a nungzuite tungah, “Mihonpite pawl khat ciang sawmnga bang veu a pawl a pawlin tosak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nungzuite in tua bangin a vawt zawk uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesus in anluum luum nga le ngasa tawn nii la in vantung en to a, Pathian tungah lungdam a ko zawkciang tuate balneen in, mipite sungah hawm tu in a nungzuite pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in ne hon a, a kham teak in a neak zawk uh ciang, a kham vaal nungzuite in khum 12 dim nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni khat Jesus ama nguak thungenin a om laitak nungzuite ama kungah hong pai uh hi. “Mihonte in kei akua hi hong ci ziam,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pawlkhat in Tuiphumpa John hi hong ci hi. A dangte in Elijah hi hong ci om a, aheap in taanghlai a kamsaangte khat hong nungta kik hi vak hong ci uh hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Note in kei akua hi nong ci uh ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Peter in zo a, “Nang sia Pathian ii Messiah ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in hi thu kuama tungah a son ngawl natu in nasia tak thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in, “Mihing Tapa in nasia takin thuak tu a, upate, thiampi liante le thukham hil syate in nial tu hi. Ama kithatlum tu hi, ahihang ni thum zawkciangin nuntakna sungah kitho kiksak tu hi,” ci in son lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciangin amate theampo tungah hi bangin ci hi, “Kei nung hong zui nuam khat po in ama le ama kinial in a thinglamtee ni simin pua in hong zui tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a kuama po ama nuntakna a hu nuam sia in taan tu a, ahihang kei hangin a nuntakna a taan sia in a nuntakna a hu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihing khat in leitung theampo a nga hangin ama nuntakna a sumh, ahibuale a taan le bang phatuamna om ziam? Phattuamna om ngawl het hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing khat in kei le ka hilnate tungtaang ah a mai a zum le, Mihing Tapa in ama ii vaangletna, Pa vaangletna le vantunglalang thiangthote ii vaangletna taw hong pai ciangin tua mipa tungah a maizum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A maan takin kong ci ciang, hi lai a om pawlkhatte in Pathian Ngam a mu phot ngawlin a thi buatu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thute a son zawk nipi khat bang zawkciang, Jesus in Peter, John le James sam a, mual tungah thungen tu in paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama thu a nget laitakin, a maitang pianzia hong kikheal a, a puansilhte kaangin tee ziazua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thakhat thu in mihing nii hong theng a, ama taw kipaupui hi. Amate sia Moses le Elijah hi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />amate in vantung vaangletna taw hong kilangh in, Jerusalem ah a thi natu Pathian tupna huvau a khuangkhim nai na thu Jesus taw kikum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Peter le a kitholpuite mutthip in om uh a, ahizong a khanlaw ciangin Jesus ii vaangtaang le ama taw a ding khawmte nii mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua mihingte nii in Jesus a nusiat ciangin, Peter in, “Topa hi sungah ih om sia bangza in nuam ziam? Buk thum sa tawng, nang atu khat, Moses atu khat, Elijah atu khat sa tawng,” ci hi. (Ama in bang teng pau cisia a he tak bua hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuabang a pau laitakin, meeikaai khat hong piang a, a limh taw amate tuam hi. A meeikaai sia nungzuite tungah zaam ahikom amate lau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Meeikaai sung panin aw khat nging a, “Hi in ka tealsa ka Tapa ahi hi — ama aw na ngai tavun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Awnging sia a tawp ciangin, Jesus ama nguak om hi. Nungzuite in pau ngawlin, a mu nate tua hun laitak kuama munah a son bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A zing ciangin Jesus in a nungzuite thum taw mualtung panin tuaksuk a, mihon khat in Jesus muak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mihon kawm panin mihing khat au a, “Sya awng! kong thuum hi. Tapa khat bek ka nei sia — hong etsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Doaite khat in au khat sua in, ama man a, ama ii kam pan cilphuan tha in butthi kaikinsak a, tawlnga ngawlin vawtsia a, thasua nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na nungzuite munah hong nawkeaksak natu ka nget hangin, hong naw keaksak thei ngawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesus in zo kik a, “Bangzata upna nei ngawl a mikhialte hi nu ziam! No taw bang tanvei hong omkhawm zo tu a, bang tanvei hong dual zo tu khi ziam? Na tapa hi sungah hong paipui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Patang sia hong paipui laitakin doai in lei denna in nei a, butthi in kaikinsak hi. Jesus in thaa ngilo tungah thupia a, patang sia damsakin, a pa tungah aap kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mihing a om theampo in Pathian ii a lian mama a vaangletna lamdang sa uh hi. A vawt theampo mihingte in lamdang a sak laitakin, Jesus in nungzuite munah hi bangin ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Kong son tu teng na ma ngil heak vun! Mihing Tapa sia mihingte ii vaangletna khut sungah ki aap tu hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahizong a nungzuite in hi thu ii khiakna a tel bua uh hi. A tel zawk ngawl natu in kiphualseal a, tuaciang amate in, hi thu huvau dongh ngam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nungzuite sungah akua lianbel ziam ci thu kinialna piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesus in amate thinsung ah bang ngaisun ziam ci thu tel ahikom, patangno khat la in, ama kungah dingsak a, amate tungah hi bangin ci hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />“Mihing khat pawpo in, hi patangno sia ka min taw a saang le keima hong saang ahi hi; tuaciang kei hong saang sia in kei hong sawlpa saang ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile, no sungah a nobel sia in, a lianbel ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />John hong pau a, “Topa awng, nangma min taw doaite notkeak khat ka mu a, a kheal natu ka tho uh hi, banghang ziam cile ama ei pawl ahi bua hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesus in ama tung le a nungzui dangte tungah, “Ama na tho heak vun, banghang ziam cile no hong langpan ngawl peuma no sang hong pawl ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Jesus vantung ah a kilaak tu a nai ciangin, a thin hong khensat a, Jerusalem khua sang manaw in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ama mai ah kamtaite paikholsak a, Samaria khuano khat sungah tumin na theampo ama atu kinging kholsa a om natu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ahihang tua munah a mihingte in ama a saang bua uh hi, banghang ziam cile ama Jerusalem khua sang manaw in a pai ahi sia a kitel hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Nungzuite James le John in hi thu a mu uh ciangin, “Topa awng, amate haltham tu in, vantung pan meikuang khat samsuk le ung nong oai ziam,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Jesus in kingeilee in teih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus le a nungzuite khuano dang khat ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Lampi ah a pai laitakin, mihing khat in Jesus tungah, “Na paina theampo ah kong zui tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jesus in zo kik a, “Ngiate in kua nei uh a, vacimte in bu a nei uh hi, ahihang Mihing Tapa in a lusial natu mun zongh a nei bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Midang khat munah, “Hong zui ta'n,” ci hi. Ahihang tua pa in, “Topa awng, ka pa hong vuisak phot ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Jesus in, “Mithite in amate ii mithite vui tahen, nang na hile pai in, Pathian Ngam thu thangsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Midang khat in, “Kong zui tu hi Topa awng, ahihang ka innkuanpuite taw kivaithakna vawt phot tong,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />“Mihing khat lotho a kipan sia in, nungsang a lee et kikik le Pathian Ngam atu in, ama kimanna om ngawl hi,” Jesus in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia zawkciang Topa in, a dang sawmsali le nii teal a, nii veu kop in, ama mama ii pai natu khua le munte ah paikholsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah, “Anlaak tu tam hi, ahihang an kaikhawm tu naseam tawm hi. A anla tu naseamte hong puak natu in, anneipa tungah thungen vun” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pai tavun! Ngia hon sungah tuunote tha bangin kong tha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sumbawm ahizong, thung ahizong, peangdap ahizong keng heak vun; Lampi ah ngual paupui tu in tawlnga heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn khat pawpo sungah, na tum uh ciang, a masa phit in, “Hi inn ah thupha hong tung tahen!” na ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thupha a saang nuam mihing khat po a om le na thupha piak uh kip tahen a, tuabang ahibuale, na thupha piak uh dok kik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua inn ah taam tavun a, hong piak pawpo ne in, dawn vun, banghang ziam cile naseam khat sia thaman a saan tu kilawm hi. Inn khat pan inn khat ah kikhiin kawkoai heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuapi khat sungah na tum uh ciang, no hong kisaang le, na mai ah hong kilui pawpo ne vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua khua ah ciinate damsak vun a, ‘Pathian ngam, no taw hong kinai zo hi!’ ci in mite tungah son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang khuapi khat sungah, na tum uh ciangin, no hong kisaang buale, lampi ah pusuak tavun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Na khua leivui ka peang tungah hong baangte kong thin kik uh hi, ahizong Pathian Ngam, no taw kinai zo hi, ci phawk vun!’ ci tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tatak ka ci ciang, Thukhenna Ni ciangin, Pathian in, tua khua sangin, Sodom khua hesuak zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nang atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam, Chorazin awng! nang atu in bangza lauhuai ziam, Bethsaida awng! no sungah hong kivawt nalamdangte Tyre le Sidon ah kivawt thong le tua khua mite in, a mawnate pan kisiik kikna uh, a kilangh natu in, khuangeipi pek lai panin, khau-ip puan silhin to in amate le amate vut kithe tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in Thukhenna Ni ciangin, note sangin Tyre le Sidon khuate hesuak zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Capernaum awng! Nang na hile nangma le nangma vantung ah kilaamto nuam ni ziam? Hell sungah hong kisepsuk tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzuite munah, “No thuson hong ngaite in, kei thu hong ngai ahi hi. No hong nial peuma in, kei hong nial ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sawmsali le niite in, lungdamna lianpi taw cia kik uh a, “Topa awng, na min taw thu ka piak uh ciangin doaite ngawngawn in ka thu uh hong ni hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesus in zo kik a, “Vantung panin Satan sia khualeng bangin a taaksuk ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai vun! Ngulte le aikamte na totcip natu le na Ngalpa ii thahatna na zaw zawk natu in, no tungah thuneina hong pia zo khi hi, bangma in no hong susia zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong thaa ngilote ii na thu uh hong nit sia, lungdam heak vun, vantung a, na min uh a kiteptee hu in, lungdam zaw tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Jesus Thaa Thiangtho in lungdamna taw kidimsak a, hi bangin ci hi. “Van le lei ii Topa ahi Pa awng! Na tungah ka lungdam hi, banghang ziam cile mihing pilte le mihing ciimte mun panin na seal thute pilna a nei ngawlte tungah na lak hi. Hi hi, Pa awng, hi bang tu ma na deina ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka pa in na theampo kei hong pia zo hi. Tapa akua ziam ci sia Pa simngawl kuama in a he bua hi, tuaciang Pa akua ziam ci sia Tapa le Tapa ii heaksak tu in a tealte ngawl po in a he bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in, a nungzuite sang nga in, hi bangin ci tuam hi, “Na mu uh nate hu in, bangza in hampha nu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei kong cina pan, kamsaang tam mamate le kumpite in, no ii mute mu nuam ahihang mu ngawl uh hi, za nuam ahihang za ngawl uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thukham hil sya khat hong pai in Jesus aitaa nuam a, “Sya awng, tawntung nuntakna ka nga natu in bang ka vawt tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesus in zo kik a, “Laithiangtho in bang ci ziam, nang tua thu bangbangin na tel ziam” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua pa in zo kik a, “Na Topa Pathian sia na thin theampo, na thaa theampo, na thahatna theampo le na ngaisutna theampo taw na it in. Tuaciangin nangma le nangma na ki it bangma in, na innpaamte na it in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus in, “Na ci teng maan hi, tuabangin ngamta lete na nungta tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahihang Thukham hil syapa in, ama le ama kitangsak nuam ahikom, hi bangin Jesus dongh thua hi, “Ka innpaam pa sia akua ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesus in zo kik a, “Khatvei lai in pasal khat, Jerusalem panin Jericho khua ah a paisuk laitakin, ngual suam phalakte in suam a, a pum tung a om teng sutin, saat zazaan a, a thi dektakin nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thiampi khat tua lampi tawnsuk luilam ahihang, tua a liampa a mu ciangin, lampi langkhat ah pial in, paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuabang ma in, Levi mi khat hong pai a, mihing liampa a mu ciangin, lam langkhat tawnin paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang khualhaw Samaria pa khat hong pai a, mihing liampa a mu ciangin, a thinsung ah hesuakhuai sakna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama kungah zuan a, a liammate sathau le sapittui noisak in, tuamsak hi. Tua zawkciangin, a liampa sia a laa tungah suanhto a, zintun inn khat ah paipui in ou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A zing ciangin, ama in ngun dangka pheak nii la in, zin innneipa pia hi. ‘Ama na ousak in. Kong pai kik ciangin, ama tungah na bona dang theampo zongh kong pia tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in thukhupna in, “Nang ii ngaisutna ah, tua mihing thumte sung pan akuabel in, mihing suamte ii sukcippa tungah innpaamte ngamtat tu bangin, ngamta na sa ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thukham hil syapa in, “Ama tungah a thuthiam sia hi,” ci in zo kik hi. Jesus in, “Tua ahile va pai ta'n a, tuabangin seam ta'n,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesus le a nungzuite a papai uh ciang, khuano khat theng a, Martha a kici numei khat in a inn ah zin do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in Mary a kici suapuinumei khat nei a, tua nu in Topa peang kungah to in, ama hilnate ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Martha sia nasep theampo ama ki awn ahikom diksa ngawlin hong pai a, “Topa awng, ka suapuinu in na theampo kei sep tu in, hong nusiat sia samh sa ngawl ni ziam?” Kei hong hu natu in hong sawlsak ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Topa in zo kik a, “Martha, Martha awng, Na tam mama tungah thinngim in buai ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahihang a kisamh khat bek om hi. Mary in vawt tu a kilawm sia teal zo hi. Ama tung pan tuasia kilaaksak ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Jesus in mun khat ah thungen hi. A man ciangin a nungzuite khat in, “Topa awng, John ii a nungzuite a hil bangin, ko zongh thunget natu hong hil ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah, “Thu na nget uh ciangin hi bangin ci vun: ‘Pa awng, Na min thiangtho ki upat tahen; Na Ngam hong piang tahen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni simin ka khamkhop tu an hong pia ta in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ko tung hong khialte ka maisak uh bangma in, kote khialna zongh hong maisak ta in, Ze etna haksa hong thuaksak heak in,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzuite munah, “Sonteena in no sung pan khat in, na lawmte inn khat ah, zankim laitak pai in, ‘Lawm awng, anluum thum hong puk ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lawmte khat khualhaw in ka inn ah hong tung a ka piak tu nei ngawl khi hi!’ ci le uhte tuasia ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />na lawmpa in a inn sung panin hong zo kik hen a, ‘Hong nawngkaisak heak in! Kongkha kikalh zo a, ka tate zongh lum siat zo hi; tho kik in bang khat po kong piak tu suak thei ngawl hi, ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hong cile bangbang hi tu ziam? A ngualtamh khat na hikomin hong tho kik a, anluum hong piak ngawl hang maizum ngawlin ngen kenkon po lete ama in, tho in na kitaangsap theampo hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom a tatakin kong ci ciang: Ngen vun, hong kipia tu hi; zong vun, na mu tu uh hi; king vun, kongkha hong kihon tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a ngente theampo in nga tu a, a zongte theampo in mu tu hi; a king pawpo tungah kongkha kihon tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pa ahi note khat po in, na tapa ii ngasa hong nget ciang, ngul na pia tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aktuui hong nget ciangin, aikam na pia tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na phat ngawl uh kawm panin, na tate atu na pha piak tu na he uh hi. Tua ahile vantung a om na Pa uh in, a ngente tungah Thaa Thiangtho pia kan ngawl tu ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in a pau thei ngawl doai khat notkeak hi; doai hong pusua zawkciang mihingpa pau thei hi. Mihonpi in lamdang sa uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahizong pawlkhatte in, “A nawkeak thei natu vaang a pia pa sia, doaite sung pan a lianbel Beelzebul ahi hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A dang pawlkhatte in Jesus aitaa a, ama nasepna tungtaang ah Pathian lungkimpuina a om le a om ngawl a tel nopna in, nalamdang lakna khat ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in amate ngaisutna teng tel ahikom, amate tungah hi bangin, ci hi, “Ngam khat sia ama le ama kikhen in a kido le bangma hun in kip ngeingawl tu hi; innkuan khat zongh kikhen in a kilem buale tamhtham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom Satan ngamsung teng zongh pawl tuatuamin kikhen hen a, khat le khat kido le, bang tanvei kip tu ziam? Note in kei sia Beelzebul ii vaangletna taw doaite not hi hong ci nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei in tuabangin doaite not ka hile, na nungzuite in bangbangin not ziam? Noma ii nungzuite in, na khial uh hunlam lak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />No ci bang hi ngawl hi. Pathian vaang taw doaite not ka hi zaw hi, tuaciang Pathian Ngam sia no sungah hong theng zo hi, ci in hi thu mama in lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Pasal thahat khat in a ngalhiamte taw kithoai sa in a inn a cing le, a neisa theampo bit tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang a hat zaw khat in ama simin a zo le, a suan a muan ngalhiam theampo sut tu a, tua pa ii neisa ngalvanh teng ama in ngual hawmsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Khat pawpo kei sang hong pang ngawl sia in kei hong langpan takpi ahi hi; khat pawpo in kei hong khoptua pui buale a tatakin a thethaang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Thaa ngilo khat in mihing khat sung pan a pusua zawkciangin, munko na ah vak in, tawlngak natu zong hi. Tawlngak natu a mu buale ama le ama hi bangin, ‘Ka inn ah cia kik tong,’ kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabangin a cia kik ciangin, a inn sia a thiangtho in kipuua sa in a om mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaciang in ama sangin a ngilo zaw thaa dang sali hong ciapui a, amate in tuasung ah teang uh hi. A tawpna ah tua mihingpa sia, a masa lai sangin lawmawk zaw hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesus in hi teng a ci zawkciang, mihonpi sung panin numei khat in, “Nang hong hing a noaitui hong pia numei in, bangza in thupha nga ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahizong Jesus in, “Tua sangin Pathian kammal za a, a zuite in bangza in thupha nga zaw ziam!” ci in, zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mipite in Jesus kiim pan in, hong uumci uh ciangin, “Tu hun mihingte bangzata in ngilo ziam! Nalamdang lakna khat hong ngengen hi. Ahizong Jonah ii nalamdang lakna sia simngawl, a dang bangma kipia ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nineveh khua mite atu in kamsaangpa Jonah sia, lim lakna khat ahi bangma in, Mihing Tapa zong tu hun mihingte atu in, lim lakna khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thukhenna Ni ciangin, Sheba Kumpinu hong ding tu a, tu hun mihingte hong mawsak tu hi. Banghang ziam cile ama ii ngam panin Solomon Kumpipa ii ciimna taw hilnate ngai tu in khual hong haw hi. A tatakin ka ci ciang, Solomon sangin a lianzaw khat hi sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thukhenna Ni ciangin, Nineveh khua mite hong ding tu a, no hong mawsak tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Jonah thuhilna a zaak uh ciangin a mawna uh panin, kisiik kik uh hi; a tatakin ka ci ciang, hi sungah Jonah sangin a lianzaw khat om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Kuama in mei a vaak ciang phual ngawl a, kuang taw zonghin khup ngawl hi. Tua hi ngawl zaw in, hong sungtang po ii mu thei tu in, meivakna khuam tungah kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na mittangte uh sia na pumpi atu meivak taw kibang hi. Na mittang uh a ciidam le, na pumpi uh sia khuavak taw kidim hi; ahizong na mittang uh a pha buale na pumpi bup uh sia khuazing sungah om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahikom na pumpi sungah khuavak sia khuazing na suaksak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na pumpi bup uh sia, khuavak taw kidim a khen khat po khuazing sungah a om bua nale, meivak sia na tungah hong taan bangma in, a vekpi taang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jesus in a pau tu teng a man zawkciang, Pharisee khat in an ne tu in sam hi. Tua ahikom ama pai in an ne tu in to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pharisee pa in Jesus anneak ma in a khut sil ngawlin om a mu ciang lamdang sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in ama tungah, “Tu in no Phariseete na kuang na hai uh a puasang panin na thiangsak uh hi. Ahihang na sungsang uh ah ngitlona le ngoltolna taw na kidim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A mawmawte awng! A puasang a vawt Pathian in a sungsang zongh vawt hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahihang na kuang le na haite ii sung a omte sia a zawngte pia le uhte no atu in na theampo sia zeksa huvau in thiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“No Phariseete atu bangza in lauhuai ziam! Pathian atu in, ante, lonamsia, bokbawnkha le khuahun zui in a piang an tuatuamte tung pan sawm a khat na pia uh hi. Ahihang Pathian it natu le thutang khenna ngaingon nu hi. A dangte zongh ngaingon tuan ngawlin hite na sep tatak tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“No Phariseete atu in, bangza in lauhuai ziam! Synagogue sungah a kikhealsia tokhumte na thangai uh a, vanh zuakna munah kizatak piaknate dik na sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Bangza in lauhuai ziam! No sia a kilangh ngawl thaan, ngual in a tungtawn a, a heak ngawlin a sicilte taw na kibang uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Thukham hil sya khat in, “Sya awng hi teng na ci ciangin ko zongh hong selno na hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesus in zo a, “No thukham hil syate atu zongh bangza in lauhuai ziam! Mihingte ii nungzaang ah vanhngitte na suanh uh a, ahihang tua vanhngitte puak zawk natu in, na khutme dawn beak zongh taw na hu nuam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />No atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam! Na taanghpupite ii suamlup kamsaangte atu in a hoi mama thaante na vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ahikom noma ii na sepna in na taanghpupite ii ngamtatnate a lungkimpui na suak uh hi. Amate in kamsaangte suamlum a, note in a thaan uh na vawtsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hi thu hu in Pathian ii Ciimna in hi bangin ci hi. ‘Kamsaangte le kamtaite ka paisak tu hi. Amate in pawlkhat thatlum tu a, a dangte vawtsia tu uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua ahikom simlei kibitphua pan kipan a kisuamlum kamsaang theampo hangin, tu hun a mihingte daan kipia tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Abel kisuamlupna pan kipan biaknatau le Thiangtho Mun, kilaklaw ah Zechariah a kisuamlupna dong huam tu hi. Hi hi, hong son khi hi, tu hun a mihingte tuate theampo hu in, daan kipia tu hi!.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate awng, no atu in, bangza in lauhuai ziam! Heakna kikholna inn kongkha tawtangte na keam uh hi; tua inn sungah noma tatak na tum nuam bua uh a, tum tu in a hanciamte na khaktan uh hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Jesus in tua mun a nusiat ciangin, Thukham hil syate le Phariseete in ama nasia takin a maw natu zong uh a, thu tam mama dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />a kampau khialna khat po taw a mat thei natu, aitaa tu in hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing tul tam mamate kiphulungin khat le khat peang kisiik tha in a om laitak Jesus in a nungzuite munah a masa phitbelin hi bangin ci hi, “Pharisee te ii tol panin na kikeam vun — amate kihisak theamna ka cinopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kisiin theampo kihong tu a, thuku a minpiang kipholaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom khuazing sungah a kison peuma suntangin kiza tu a, inn doituam kikhak sungah na kihuau uh peuma innkhum dawn panin ki au keak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka lawmte awng, hong ci khi hi. Pumpi bek that thei a tua zawkciang a sia zaw a hong vawt thei ngawlte na kiita heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kiitak tu akua ziam ci sia kong lak tu hi. Pathian na kiita vun, ama in a thalup zawkciang meikuang sungah bum thei lai hi. Hong um tavun, na kiitak tu uh sia ama ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tonbawm nga ciang dangka san pheak nii taw kizuak hi ngawl ziam? Hi nave tonbawm khat zongh Pathian in mangil ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lu tung a samzamte ngawngawn hong kisimsak siat sa ahi hi. Tua ahikom lau heak vun. No sia tonbawm tam mamate sangin manpha zaw nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A maan takin kong ci ciang, mipite mai ah keima ii mi ahi hunlam a pualaakte sia Mihing Tapa zongh in Pathian vantunglalangte mai ah tuabang ma in a pualaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang mihonpi mai ah kei hong nialte sia Mihing Tapa in Pathian vantunglalangte mai ah nial tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa langpanna kam khat a pau pawpo sia kimaisak thei hi; ahizong Thaa Thiangtho langpanna kamsia a pau khat pawpo kimaisak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Synagogue mai ah ahizong, ngam uk maangte le hong ukte mai ah ahizong, thusit tu in hong kipaipui ciang noma bangbangin kihung tu a, bang teng pau tu ci in thinngim heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Thaa Thiangtho in tua hun ciangin na pau natu hong hil tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihon sung panin pasal khat in Jesus tungah, “Syapa awng, ka pa ii nei le lamh hong nusiatte, ka suapuipa ii hong hop natu in hong sawlsak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in zo kik a, “Pasalpa awng, no nii ii kilaklaw ah neisate hawm tu le thukhen tu in akua in kei tungah thuneina hong pia ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate tungah hi bangin ci thua hi. “Duhopna namcinte panin, noma le noma kikeam tavun. Banghang ziam cile bangza po in a haubel hangin mihing khat ii nuntakna tatak sia neisa lamhsate hi ngawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in hi thusonteena amate tungah son hi: “Khatvei lai in, sumhau khat om a, a leitang tung panin thaw an tam mama piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama le ama hi bangin ngaisun hi, ‘Ka an theampo ka koi natu ansaal nei ngawl khi hi. Bang law tu khi ziam?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Hi bangin vawt tong,’ ama le ama kici hi, ‘Ka ansaal luite pheltham tong ii, a lianzaw in ka sa tu a, tua munah ka an teng le ka vanh dang teng ka khol tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin keima le keima hi bangin ka kici tu hi. Mihing hamphapa awng! Kum tam mama na khom tu na pha theampo nei zo ni hi. A ol nawno in nungta ta'n a, ne in dawn lel in. A nuam in om ta'n!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in ama tungah hi bangin ci hi, ‘Mihing mawmaw pa awng! Zan ciang mama in na nuntakna na aap kul tu hi; tua hile nangma atu na kholsa hi teng sia akua in tang tu ziam?’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang in Jesus ii a thukhupna ah, “Pathian muna ah hauna ahi ngawl leitung haunate amate atu a kholte sia tu a ih son sia pa bang ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in a nungzuite munah, “Tua ahikom nuntak natu a kisamh ante atu ahizong, pumpi atu a kisamh puante atu ahizong, tuate huvau in, thinngim heak vun kong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nuntakna in an sangin thupizaw pek a, tuaciang pumpi in puante sangin thupi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Va-akte en vun: amate in anciite tu ngawlin, an le la ngawlin, ansaal le beamte a nei bua hi. Pathian in amate vaak hi! Vacimte sangin note tam mama in manpha zaw pek nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />No sungah akua in thinngimna taw na khan uh tawm na khangkhan thei uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A son thamman ngawl tuabang thuno khat zongh, na vawt thei bua uh le, nadang tungtaang ah banghangin thinngim nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Unok paakte en vun, bangbangin khang ziam: amate in na le seam ngawl a, khau le zom ngawl hi. Ahizong a tatak ci leang Solomon Kumpipa a haubel sia zongh hi paakte sangin a hoi zaw puansilh nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuni in hing a zing ciang a vul, a kihal lopate a zeam sia Pathian ahi hi. Ama in no sia puan taw hong khu seseam ngawl tu ziam? Na nei uh upna sia bangza in no ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tua ahikom bang ka ne tu, bang ka dawn tu ci in thintoi heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />(Banghang ziam cile leitung ah, Pathian a he ngawlte in, hi bang teng thinbot in nei uh hi.) Na Pa in hite na kisap hunlam uh hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama Ngam na zong masa vun. Tua hile ama in hite theampo zongh hong pia thua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tuu honnote awng, lau heak vun. Banghang ziam cile na Pa in Ngam hong pia nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na neisa theampo zuak vun a, na nga uh sumte a zawngte pia vun. Na hauna uh sia van ah na khol vun, tua munah a man sulh ngeingawl tu hi. Banghang ziam cile tua munah ngutate in ngu thei ngawl a, nget in ne thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile na sum na paai omna munah, na thin na lung uh zongh om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Hong tung tu thu khat pawpo atu in, a kingingta sa in om vun. A diang tawm tu in puansilh kholsa le meiinn vaak sa in om vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mopoai panin a topa hong cia kik tu a ngak naseamte bang na hi vun. Ama hong cia a, kongkha hong kih ciangin, amate in thakhat thu in kongkha hon tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama hong cia kik ciangin a kinging sa in a om, a khuaphawk naseamte, a topa in a mu ciang amate bangzata in thupha a nga tu ziam? A maan takin kong ci ciangin, a topa in a laktong puasilh suut tu a, amate a tosak zawkciang anvaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zankim laitak ahizong, tua zawkciang ahizong, ama hong cia hun in, a kinging sa a om naseamte in bangzata in thupha a nga tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Inn nei khat in nguta hong pai tu hun he khol le a inn sia nguta in phuulsak ngawl tu ci in na tel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />No zongh a kinging sa in om vun, banghang ziam cile, Mihing Tapa sia na muanmawk ngawl uh hun khat in hong pai tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Peter in, “Topa awng, tu a thusonteena sia ko atu na ci ziam tua ahibuale ngual theampo atu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua ahile thumaan a, a ciim naseampa akua ziam? Tua pa in a inn a uk tu le, naseam dangte a hun ciang an pia tu in a topa ii sawlpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A topa hong cia kik ciang, hi bangin naseampa nasep mu thong le naseampa bangzata in lungdam tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A tatak ka ciciang, a topa in tua naseampa sia a neisa theampo a uk tu in koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahizong tua naseampa in a topa hong cia kik tu khuangei lai tu zam ci in, naseam dang pate le numeite vel ngawp tu in kithoai hen a, anne tuidawn zukham in om le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />a topa sia muanmawk ngawl ni khat, a heak ngawl hun khat ciangin hong heak kik tu hi. A topa in ama saat zazaan tu a, thu ni ngawlte ii thuak teng thuaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“A topa ii seam le a oai teng, tel napi a, a seam tu in, a kithoai ngawl tua naseampa nasia takin, velna kithuaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahizong a topa ii deina tel ngawlin, vel thuak natu ngamtatna a nei le, ama sia a nasia lei ngawlin kivel tu hi. Tam a kipiate tung panin tam kingen tu hi; tam seseam a kipiate tung pan, a tam seseam kingen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Leitung a hal tu in kong pai a, tu in a kuangsa hile ka oai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Kibaptize na ka nga tu khat om a, tuasia a kimanthiang mateng in bangza in ka thin patau ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Leitung ah kilemna puak tu in hong pai hong sa nu ziam? Hi ngawl hi, kilemna hi ngawlin, kikhenna pia tu in kong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tu panin kipan mihing nga a pha innkuan khat sia kikhen tu a, a lang ah thum pang tu a, a lang ah nii pang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Pate in tapate langpan tu a, tapate in pate langpan tu hi; nute in tanute langpan tu a, tanute in nute langpan tu hi; tonupite in mote langpan tu a, mote in tonupite langpan tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Mipite tungah Jesus in hi bangin ci hi. “Nitumna sang pan meeikaai khat na mu uh ciang nguazu vak thakhat thu in na ci uh a, zu takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tuaciang thangsang panin vui hong vak na phaw uh ciangin, nisa vak, na ci uh a, sa takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A kihisak theamte awng! van le lei en in khuahunte na sonkhol thei uh hi; tua ahile banghangin tu hun ii a khiakna tel ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“Thumaan thutang vawt tu in banghang khensat ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in na tungah thu hong vawt in zum tungah hong then le thukhenzum na thet ma in, na kituu uh thute ama taw kilemtua tu in hanciam vun. Tua ahibuale thukhenmangte mai ah hong kai in, tuate in palikte khut sungah hong aap tu a, thong sungah hong khum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />A maan tak kong ci ciang, tua munah na om tu a, na liausum a cin dong thong na taak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin, tua munah a om mihing pawlkhat in, sangaw biakpiakna pia in Pathian a bia Galilee mite Pilate ii a thalup huvau Jesus tungah son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesus in zo kik a, “Tua Galilee mite sia tuabangin a kithalup hu in, Galilee midangte sangin mawzaw ahi hunlam kilangh hi ci nuam na hi uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi ngawl het hi! A tatakin kong ci ciang, no zongh na mawna uh pan na kisiik kik bua uh le amate bangma in na thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siloam ah tausaang khat a cipsuk lai in, sawm le liat a thina thu bangbangin na ngaisun uh ziam? Hi mite in Jerusalem midang theampo sangin mawna lianzaw nei ahi hunlam kilangh hi ci in na ngaisun uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi ngawl het hi! A tatak kong ci ciangin no zongh na mawna pan, na kisiik kik bua uh le, amate bangma in na thi siat tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in hi thusonteena amate tungah son hi. “Khatvei lai in mihing khat ii sapithuan sungah theikung khat po hi. Ama in theinga vil tu in pai ahihang bangma a mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang huanthopa tungah hi bangin ci hi. ‘En in, theinga vil a ka pai zawk kum thum pha zo a, bangma mu ngawl khi hi. Phuktan in! lei tulsak tu in banghang kihoai ziam?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong huanthopa in zo kik a, ‘Topa awng, kum khat sung teng na thutha heak lai in a kung kiimkot to in eaklei kong buak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Theikung sia hong nga le pha seseam hi, tuabang ahibuale na phuk thei tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sabbath ni khat Jesus in synagogue khat ah thuhilna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua munah numei khat thaa ngilo vei in, kum sawm le kum liat a ciina hi. Ama bawngcip in a dingmaam thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesus in a mu ciangin biakpui a, “Numei awng na natna panin na suakta zo hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tungah a khut nga a, tuasia ciang thakhat thu in, dingmaam a, Pathian pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Synagogue keam upa pa in Sabbath ni a, Jesus ii ciina a damsak hu in, a thin uuk hi. Tua ahikom mipite tungah, “Nipi khat sungah na ih sep natu ni luk om hi. Tua ahiciang, tua nite ah ciidam nga tu in hong pai tavun a, Sabbath ni in hong pai heak vun” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in zo a, “No mihing a kihitheamsakte awng! No sungah khat pawpo in, Sabbath ni in na khuital ahizong, na laa uh ahizong, tui pia tu in, a buk sung panin, pusua hi ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu in hi munah Abraham tanu khat Satan in kum sawm le kum liat kol bulin om hi. Sabbath ni in tua kolkhau panin suut tu in kilawm ngawl ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A zo kikna kammalte hu in, a ngalte a mai uh zum a, mipite ahile, a lamdang nasepnate tungah lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jesus in, “Pathian Ngam sia bang taw kibang ziam? Bang taw ka teengat tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tuasia in hi bang hi. Mihing khat in ankamhcii tang khat la a lo sungah tu hi. A kung khangin, thingkung khat suak hi. Vacimte in a baak kawmah bu vawt uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesus in dongh kik a, “Pathian Ngam sia bang taw teengat tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia in hi bang hi. Numei khat in tol tawm la a, anvui khum khat dim taw hel in, a vekpi in pawm hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesus in khuapi le khuanote kaantan kawmin, hilna nei a Jerusalem sang zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawlkhat in dongh a, “Topa awng, mihing tawm bek in ngupna nga tu ahi ziam?” ci hi. Jesus in zo kik a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Kongkha ciakna sungah na tum thei natu in, hanciam vun; banghang ziam cile mihing tam mamate in tum tu in hanciam tu a, a tum zo buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Inn nei pa in tho in, kongkha hong khak tu hi. Tuasia ciang doipua pan in, kongkha king in, ‘Topa kong hong hon ta'n,’ na ci uh hang, ‘No koisung pan hong pai ci hong he ngawl khi hi,’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, ‘Nang taw annekhawm tuidawn khawmte khu hi, ka khuapi sung a thu zongh hong hil ni hi!’ na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang hi bangin hong ci tu hi. ‘Ka kung panin tai vun, mihing ngilote awng!’ hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Noma teng doipua ah hong kipuavawk laitakin Abraham, Isaac, Jacob le kamsaang dangte sia Pathian Ngam sungah na mu uh ciang, bangza in kap in ha ngoai in om tu nu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihingte sia nisuana le nitumna, sak le thang panin hong pai tu a, Pathian Ngam sungah poai hong siim tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin tu laitakin a nungkhakte hong masa tu a, tu laitakin a masate hong nungkhak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua laitak ma in Phariseete pawlkhat, Jesus kungah hong pai a, “Hi sung panin pusuak in, leidang mun khat zuan ta'n, banghang ziam cile Herod in nang hong that nuam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jesus in zo a, “Noma pai tavun a, tua ngia tungah hi bangin ci tavun. ‘Tuni le zing ciangin, doai ka not tu a, ciina ka damsak tu hi, a ni thum ni ciangin ka nasep ka man tu hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang tuni, zing ciang le thai ciangin ka pai tu kul hi. Jerusalem simngawl mundang ah kamsaangte kithalup tu ngeina om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Jerusalem, Jerusalem awng! Nang in kamsaangte na thatlum a, Pathian kamtaite na deanglum uh hi! Akpui in a note a tha nuai ah a huai bangin, tamvei ma na mite ka huai nuam hi. Ahizong nong oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahikom na Biakinnpi uh sia kinusia cip tu hi. A tatakin ka ci ciang, ‘Topa min taw hong pai pa tungah Pathian thupha tung tahen,’ na ci uh hun mateng kei nong mu buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus sia Phariseete lampui khat ii inn ah Sabbath ni khat, an ne tu in pai hi; tua munah a om mihingte in Jesus encik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khut le a peang a tum pasal khat Jesus kungah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuasia ciang Jesus in Thukham hil syate le Phariseete munah hi bangin dongh hi. “Ih Thukham in Sabbath ni in ciina damsak tu oai ziam, oai ngawl ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang amate a pau nuam bua uh a, Jesus in pasalpa sam in damsakin ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate tungah “No sungah na tapa uh khat ahizong, na khuital uh khat ahizong Sabbath ni in tuikhuk sungah taak luilam le tua Sabbath ni mama in thakhat thu kaito kik ngawlin na om tu uh ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong amate in hi thu huvau a zo thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leangnate pawlkhat in tona nuambel teng a teal uh Jesus in a mu ciang, a om theampo ii zaak tu in hi thusonteena son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mopoai siim tu in hong kisap ciang, tona nuambelna ah to paih heak vun. No sang in a thupi zaw mihing khat po zongh kisamh tha tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />no hong sam khawm innteakpa in no kungah hong pai in, ‘Ama na tona awn in,’ hong cile nuammaw sa in a niambel tona dangkhat ah na to uh hong kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua sangin hong kisap ciangin a niam belna ah to le uhte na innteakpa hong pai tu a, ‘lawmpa awng, hong pai in tona a nuam zawna ah hong to ta'n,’ hong cile leangna dangte theampo ii mai ah maipha na nga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama le ama a kiliansakte kiniamsak tu a, ama le ama a kiniamkhiak te kiliansak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in a innteakpa tungah, “Zing an ahibuale nitak an neakpui tu in na sap uh ciang, na lawmte, na suapuite, na mealheakte le na innpaam sumhaute sam heak in — banghang ziam cile, amate zongh in, hong sam kik tu a, tuabang teng taw in na vawtna bang hong kipia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anneakpoai na vawt ciangin, a zawngte, a koncipte, a peangbaite, le mittawte na sam tavun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua hile thupha na saang tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in hong thuk kik zo ngawl tu hi. Mihing phate thaw kik ni ciangin Pathian in hong thuk kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sabuai ah a to mihing khat in hi thu a zaak ciangin Jesus tungah “Pathian Ngamsung poai vawtna ah a to tute sia bangzata in thupha nga ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesus in ama tungah, “Khatvei lai in mihing khat in, poai lian khat vawt a, tua munah ama in mihing tam mama sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anneak tu hun hong thet ciangin leangnate munah hi bang a sonna tu in a naseampa sawl hi, “Hong pai tavun, na theampo a kinging sa in om zo hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang amate khat zawkciang khat in kamzong tek hi. A masabel pa in a naseampa tungah, ‘Lo khat ka lei a, pai in ka vil kul tu hi; hong hesuak tavun,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A dang khat in, ‘Khuital kap nga ka lei a, nasep ka hil kul tu hi; hong hesuak tavun,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A dang khat in, ‘Ka zi nei zawk hiat hi a, tua hu in hong pai thei ngawl tu khi hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Naseampa a topa kungah pai kik a, hi thu teng son hi. A topa thin uuk mama a, a naseampa munah, ‘A manlang in khua sung lam theampo ah va pai ta'n a, a zawngte, a koncipte, mittawte, le peangbaite hong ciapui ta'n,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hai ngawlin naseampa in, ‘Topa awng, nong thupiak bangin ka seam zo hi, ahizong a tamzaw lai om thei natu mun awng lai hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a topa in naseampa tungah, ‘Ngamsung lampi liante le lampinote ah va pai ta'n a, ka inn sung a dim tu in, mihingte hong tumsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tatak ka ci ciang, khual ka hil maksakte kuama in ka nitak an tep ngawl tu hi!’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khatvei mihonpite Jesus taw tonin, a paikhop laitak, amate tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“A kuama po kei nung hong zui tu sia in, a pa, a nu, a zi, a tate, a suapuipate, a suapuinute le, ama le ama mama sang zonghin kei hong it zaw buale kei nungzui a suak thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama thinglamtee pua in hong zui ngawl po ka nungzui a suak thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />No sung panin mihing khat in, tausaang khat sak a sawm le, ama in a masa phitbel in, ngeal phot tu a, sum bangza bo tu ziam ci in tuat tu hi, a sak zawk natu sum a kicing in a nei le a nei ngawl en phot tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nei buale a phungkawng a cian zawkciang, tua tausaang a man zo buatu hi; hi thu a mu a hete theampo in a nuisan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Hisia pa in inn sa tu kipan ahihang a man zo bua hi,’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa khat in mihing tulsawm taw, mihing tulkul a nei kumpi dang khat sim a sawm le, a nalh zawk natu, tha a khom nei ziam, ci sia to in, khensat phot tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tha a khom a nei buale, kumpipa dangkhat ii kungah a kikhualat lai in, kilemna thu kikum tu in, kamtaite paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuabang ma in note khat pawpo in na neisa theampo na nusia bua uh le, ka nungzui na suak thei buatu uh hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Ci al sia pha hi, ahihang a alna a bo le ki alsak kik thei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitang atu le pha ngawl, eaklei zong kizangh thei ngawl a; kivawk hi. Bil nei po in hi thu na za tavun!” ci in Jesus in thukhup hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat shiadongte le ngual ii puavawk mihing pawlkhatte in, thu ngai tu in Jesus kungah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuasia ciangin Phariseete le Thukham hil syate phun lialua uh hi, “Hisia pa in ngual ii puavawkte taw in an ngawngawn zongh nekhawm hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus in amate tungah hi thusonteena son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“No sungah khat in tuu zakhat nei hen a, tuu khat bosua le bang law tu ziam? Ama in tuu sawmkua le kua teng ngantatna ah nusia in a kibosua sia a mu dawdong zong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mu ciangin lungdam mama in a liangko mualsuan in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />inn ah ciapui tu hi. Tua zawkciang a lawmte le a innpaamte sam in, ‘Ka lungdam mama hi, ka bosua tuu sia ka mu zo hi. Lungdam poai vawt tawng,’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in kei kong ci ciang, a kisiik kik ngawl mihing zatak huai sawmkua le kua te sangin a kisiik kik mawnei khat hu in vantung ah lungdamna lian zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua ahibuale numei khat in dangkatang sawm a nei sung pan, khat bosua le — bang law tu ziam? Ama in mei de tu a, a inn sung phiat in, a mu mateng mun theampo ah pha takin zong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mu ciang a lawmte le a innpaamte kaikhawm in, ‘Ka lungdam mama hi, ka bosua dangkatang sia ka mu zo hi. Lungdam poai vawt tawng!’ ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei kong ci ciang, tuasia bangma in, mihing mawnei khat a kisiik kik hu in, Pathian vantunglalangte lungdam hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus in a son lai na pan, “Khatvei lai in pasal khat in tapa nii nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nauzaw sia in a pa tungah, ‘Pa awng, kei ii ka lua tu neisate tu in hong khen ta'n,’ ci hi. Tua ahikom a pa in a neisate a tapate nii khensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni tawmvei zawkciangin, a tapa nozaw sia in, ama ii neisa teng zuak siat a, inn nusia in a sum teng taw pusuak hi. Ngam khualana khat ah pai a, tua munah a sum teng zangh maai siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nei theampo zangh khawng hi. Tuaciangin tua ngam ah kialpi lian khat tung a, ama bangma nei nawn ngawlin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabang ahiciangin, tua ngammite khat ii kungah naseam tu in pai a, tua pa in lo sungah vokte cing tu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vokte ii neak bengapte ne nuam liang ahihang kuama in a neak tu bangma a pia bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khakbel ciangin khua phawk a, ‘Ka pa inn ah a cial naseamte zongh in, a khawn laak tu dongin an nei a, kei sia hi munah pukthi tu in ka om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ding in ka pa kungah zuan tong, Pa awng, Pathian tung le nang tungah kong khial zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tapa ci tu in ka kilawm nawn bua hi; na naseam khat bangin hong omsak ta'n ci tong,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama dingto in a pa kung zuan kik tu in kipan hi. “A inn a thet natu khuala ma samh lai kasap, a pa in mu hi; khuangai huai sa in del a, ngawngkoai in namh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Pa awng, Pathian tung le nangma tungah hong khial zo khi hi. Na tapa ci tu in ka kilawm nawn bua hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang a pa in naseamte sam a, ‘Hong manlang tavun! Puantual phabel sia la tavun a, silhsak vun. A khutme ah khutzungbu bulsak vun a, peangdap thuasak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang khuino thau sia hong kai tavun a, ngoin anneakpoai vawt tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hi ka tapa sia thi zo a, ahizong tu in hong nungta kik hi; ama bo a, tu in kimu zo hi.’ Tua hu in, poai vawt tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tua laitakin tapa lianzaw sia lokuan hi. Hong cia lam inn hong thet dektak ciang, lapna le lasakna awte za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom naseamte khat sam a, ‘Bang thu bang la ziam?’ ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Na naupa hong cia kik a, khui thau sia na pa in ngo hi, banghang ziam cile ciidam ludam a, a tapa a nga kik hang ahi hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tapa lianzaw sia thin uuk mama a, inn sung zongh ah a tum nuam bua hi; tua ahikom a pa pusuak a, a tapa ii hong sungtan natu kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahihang a pa ii kam zo a, ‘En in kum hi tanvei sal bangin na na hong sepsak a, na thu piakte hong nial ngeingawl khi hi. Kei bang nong pia ngei ziam? Keal khat beak zongh ka ngualtamhte taw ka neak tu nong pia ngei bua hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang hi na tapa in pumpi zuak numeite tungah a sum teng zangh tum siat a, tuaciang inn hong thet ciangin khuino thau sia ngaw ni hi!’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pa in, ‘Ka tapa awng, nang sia a tawntungin keima taw hi sungah a om ni hi. Ka neisa theampo nangma aa, ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahihang na naupa sia thi zo a, tu in hong nungta kik hi; ama bo a, tu in kimu zo hi. Tua ahikom lungdam in poai ih vawt kul hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzuite munah, “Khatvei lai in sumhaupa khat in a neisate a zeak tu, naseam khat nei hi. Tua naseampa in sumhaupa ii sum teng zangh tum hi, ci in sumhaupa tungah kison ahiciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />sumhaupa in sam a, ‘Na ngamtatna kong zaak sia bangbang tatak ziam? Ka neisate na zeaknate, a cing takin hong lak ta'n, banghang ziam cile kei ii neisa zeakpa hi thei nawn ngawl tu ni hi’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naseampa in hi bangin ngaisun hi, ‘Ka topa in ka nasep pan hong tawpsak tu hi. Bang law tu khi ziam? Leidum to tu in tha ka nei bua a, khutdaw nget tu le ka maizum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nasep ka taan ciangin ka ngualtamhte in amate inn ah hong saan natu bangbang ngamta tu ci he zo ing!’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom a topa tungah lei a ba theampo khawmtua hi. A masa phitbelpa munah, ‘Ka topa tungah nang bangza ba ni ziam,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Olive thau pheal zakhat ka ba hi,’ ci in zo kik hi. ‘Hi sungah na sazian om hi, to in, sawmnga ci in at in,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang khat ii tungah, ‘Nang bangza ba ni ziam? — ’ ‘Zungtaang seau tulkhat,’ ci in zo hi. ‘Hi sungah na sazian om hi, zaliat ci in at in,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hu in, a topa in a thumaan ngawl sumkeampa ii thimthel pilna teng pok hi; banghang ziam cile hi leitung mihing thimthelte sia vai tuatuam sepna ah khuavak sung om mihingte sangin pilzaw pek hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesus in hi bang ci thua hi. “Kei kong cina pan: leitung haunate taw ngualtamh zong vun, tuaciang, tuasia a bo ciang tawntung inn ah no hong kisaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thu note tungah a thumaante sia thuliante tung zongh ah thumaan tu hi; thunote tungah a thumaan ngawlte sia thuliante tung zongh ah a thumaan buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahile leitung haunate tungah na thumaan bua uh ahile hauna tatak ah bangbangin hong kimuang ngam tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngual neisa tungah na thumaan bua uh ahile, no tungah na neisate akua in hong pia nuam tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Naseam khat po in to nii ii sila sepsak thei ngawl hi; ama in khat sia ensan tu a, khat it tu hi; khat tungah thumaan tu a, khat sia ngaimaw tu hi. No sia Pathian le sum ii sila, na seam khawm thei buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Phariseete in hi thute a zaak uh ciangin Jesus sia ciammuina in nei uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate sum deite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesus in, “No sia noma le noma ngual mai ah a kithutangsakte na hi uh hi, ahizong Pathian in na thinsung theampo hong he hi. Banghang ziam cile mihingte ii thupisak nate sia Pathian muna ah man a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuiphumpa John hun ciang dongin Moses ii thukhamte le kamsaangte lai atte in thu nei hi; tuasia pan kipan Pathian ngam Lungdamna Thupha kisonin mihing sim in, tuasung ah a tum zawk natu in hanciam tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong tua Thukhamte sungah thu theklek no khat a bo tu sangin van le lei a bo tu ol zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zi a khul pasal khat in numei dang khat taw a teang kik le nupa kipalngul mawna vawt ahi hi. Tuaciangin a kikhul numei khat a teenpui pa in nupa kipalngul mawna vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Khatvei lai in sumhau khat om a puansilh manham tatakte silh in, ni simin nuamsa mama in nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua laitakin, Lazarus kici mizawngpa khat zongh om a, ama meima taw kidimin, sumhaupa ii bangkua ah kipaipui bul hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />sumhaupa sabuai pan a taakte ne tu in lametna taw tuabangin om hi. Uite ngawngawn in a meimate liasak tu in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mizawngpa thi a vantunglalangte in, vantung anneakpoai Abraham kungah to tu in, puato uh hi. Sumhaupa zongh thi in kivui hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hell sungah ngim nga mama in, ama in a etto le, a khuala na munah, Abraham le a kungah Lazarus a om mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in biakpui a, ‘Pa Abraham awng! Hong hesuak ta'n. Lazarus ii khutme dawn tui sungah pap in ka leei hong votsak tahen, banghang ziam cile hi mun meikuang sungah ngim nga mama khi hi’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahizong Abraham in, ‘Na nuntak lai in nang sia na pha theampo hong kipia zo a, Lazarus ahile a sia theampo thuak hi. Tua thu phawk ta'n. Ahihang tu in ahile nang ii natna satna na thuak laitak ama in hi munah nuamsa in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua bek dom ngawlin ih kilaklaw ah luamthuk pui khat om a, ko kung panin no kungah kipai thei ngawl a, no kung panin ko kungah kuama hong pai thei ngawl hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sumhaupa in, tua ahile Pa Abraham awng, hesuak hong ngen ing, Lazarus sia ka pa inn ah va paisak ta'n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tua munah suapui nga nei khi hi. Natna ngimna thuakna hi munah amate beak hong pai ngawl natu in pai in sonkhol le ka oai hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abraham in, ‘Na suapuite in Moses le kamsaangte nei hi. Tuate ii hilkholnate ngai tahen,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sumhaupa in zo kik a, ‘Tuabang bek kicing tham ngawl tu hi, pa Abraham awng! Ahizong a thisate khat tho kikin amate kungah pai le, tuasia ciangin a mawna uh pan kisiik pheang tu uh hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahizong Abraham in, ‘Amate in Moses le kamsaangte ii thu a ngai nuam bua uh le mithi sa khat hong thaw kik hial hangin a um tuan buatu uh hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzuite munah, “Maw thei natu ze et nate hong piang tu ma ahi hi, ahihang tua ze etna a piangsakte atu bangza in lauhuai ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing khat in hi patangnote khat a puksak sangin a ngawng ah an ngoaina suang lian khat khii in tuipi sungah kivawksuk le, ama atu in phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahiciang nasepna po ah kidawm vun! “Na suapuipa a maw le teih in, a kisiik le maisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in ni khat sungah salivei hong khial a, a simin, ‘Kisiik khi hi,’ hong cile na maisak hamtang kul tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawltakte in Topa tungah, “Ka upna uh hong khangsak ta'n,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in zo kik a, “Ankamhtang cia upna nei le uhte hi naailung kung munah, ‘Nangma le nangma kibot in tuipi sungah kiphut in!’ ci le uhte zong na thu uh hong ni tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Sonteena in no sungah khat in lotho ziam, tuucing ziam naseam khat nei hi, ama lo panin hong cia po ciang, manlang in na an ne in, na ci tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabangin kici ngawl hi! Bang kici zaw ziam cile, ‘Ka nitak an na thuuk in, awmdap na silh zawkciang, ka neak ka dawn laitakin hong ngak ta'n, tua zawkciang, nangma ne in ci tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Naseampa in sawlna teng a sep hu in, ama tungah lungdam khi hi citaak ngawl hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No zongh tuabang ma na hi natu ahi hi; hong kisawl teng na sep zawk uh ciangin, ‘Ei sia naseam ma kihi lel a, ih sep tu teng ma a kiseam hi bek hi,’ ci tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus in Samaria le Galilee ngamngi tawn in Jerusalem ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuano khat sungah a tum laitakin a lauhuai vun natna a vei mihing sawm taw kisi hi. Amate sia ama kung panin, tawm a khuala na ah dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Jesus awng! Topa awng! ko hong hesuak ta'n!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus in amate a mu ciang, “Pai tavun a, na thiampite in vealsak tavun,” ci hi. Amate a pai kawkawm in, dam thiang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A damna a kiheak ciangin, amate sung pan khat hong heak kik a, nging takin Pathian pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in Jesus peang ah bokin, lungdamko hi. “Hisia pa sia Samaria mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesus in, “A kidamsak mihing sawm pha hi; a dang teng koisungah om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghangin hi minam dang pa bek in, Pathian tungah lungdamko tu in hong heak kik ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciangin Jesus in ama tungah, “Ding in, va pai ta'n; na upna in hong damsak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pharisee te pawlkhat in Jesus munah “Pathian Ngam bang hun ciang hong tung tu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. A zo kikna ah, “Pathian Ngam sia, tuabangin mit a mu thei in hong theng ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kuama in, ‘En vun, hi munah om hi!’ tua ahibuale ‘Zia sungah om hi!’ ci thei ngawl tu hi! banghang ziam cile Pathian Ngam noma sungah om hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a nungzuite munah “Hun khat ciangin note in, Mihing Tapa ii nite sung pan ni khat beak, na mu nop tu hun hong theng tu hi, ahizong na mu buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihingte in “En vun, zia sungah!” tua ahibuale, “En vun hi sungah!” hong ci om tu hi, ahihang tuate, zong tu in pai heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khualeng sia vanmong khat pan mong khat ah kizel in, a taankeaksak bangma in, Mihing Tapa zongh ama ii ni hong tun ciangin tuabang ma hong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahizong ama in nasia takin hong thuak masa tu a, tu hun mihingte in hong nial tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing Tapa hun zongh Noah hun lai bangma hong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihingte in neakna le dawnnate vawt tan in, Noah ii teambaw sung a tum ni dong ma, numei le pa kiteang a, tuaciangin tuipi liim sia in, amate thatlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua hun sia Lot ii hun taw zong kibang tu hi. Mihing sim in neakna dawnna, vanh leina vanh zuakna, ankung ciinna, inn sakna taw hun zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sodom khua panin Lot a pusua ni in, van pan, meikuang le kaan nguazu bangin zusuk a, amate theampo thatlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihing Tapa hong kilaak ni ciangin, tuabang ma hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ni in innkhum tungah a om mihing khat in, a neisa la tu in, inn sungah tuaksuk nawn heak hen; tuasia bangma in lo sung a om mihing khat in, a inn ah cia kik nawn heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lot ii zi na phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A nuntakna a huu nuam sia in, taan tu hi; a nuntakna a taan sia in kihuu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A maan takin kong ci ciang, tua zanin mihing nii lupna tungah a lumkhawmte: khat kila tu a, khat sia kinusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Numei nii anngoai khawm a omte: khat kila tu a, khat kinusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pasal nii lo sungah a diangkhawmte: khat kila tu a, khat kikhe tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nungzuite in ama tungah, “Koisungah hi bangin piang tu ziam, Topa,” ci in dongh uh hi. Jesus in, “Thiluang omna munah vaciikte kikhawm tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in a nungzuite tungah thinkiam ngawl a, a thunget tawntung natu a hilna in thusonteenate son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khua khat ah thukhenmangpa khat om a, ama in Pathian le kiita ngawl, mihing maitang le a zakta ngawlhet khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang in tua khua ma ah, nupi meingong khat om a, ama thukhenmangpa kungah pai tawntung in, “Ka ngalte kung panin hong hung ta'n,” ci in ama ii nga tu a kilawm bang ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuangei hialma thukhenmangpa in bangma hisak nuam ngawl ahihang, a khakbel ciangin hi bangin ngaisun hi, ‘Pathian le kiita ngawlin mihingte zongh zakta ngawl ka hi hang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hi meingongnu in hong nawngkaisak ahikom, ama ii nga tu a kilawm bang a nga thei natu in ka khensak tu hi. Tuabangin ka hi buale, ama hong pai tawntung tu a, a khakbel ciangin ka thuak zo buatu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thumaan ngawl thukhenmangpa ii kammalte ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahile Pathian in ama ii mihingte, sun taw zan taw hu ngen in a au te ii phat tuam natu in thukhensak ngawl tu ziam? Amate a hu tu sia a haisaang tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A maan tak ka ci ciangin, amate sangah pangin, a manlang takin thu khensak tu hi. Ahitazong Mihing Tapa ii hong pai kik ciangin leitung ah upna a mu tu ziam?” Topa in ci thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate le amate pha kisa mama a, ngualdang theampo a zawngsak mihingte tungah Jesus in hi thusonteena zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Khatvei lai in mihing nii Biakinn ah thungen tu in pai hi: Khat sia Pharisee pa hi a, khat sia shiadongpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharisee pa in ama nguak ding a, thungen hi. ‘Pathian awng na tungah ka lungdam hi, banghang ziam cile kei sia ngualdangte bangin ka duhop bua a, leilot ngawlin, numei le pa palngul khialna ka vawt bua hi. Zia sungah shiadongpa bang hi ngawl ka hikom na tungah ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nipi khat sungah ni nii an ka tang a, ka nga sung panin, see sawm sua see khat nang kong pia hi,’ ci in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang shiadongpa ahile a khualana ah ding a, vantung zongh ento ngam ngawlin, a awm beang a, ‘Pathian awng, kei mimawpa hong hesuak ta'n!’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tatak ka ci ciang, Pharisee pa bang hi ngawlin shiadongpa sia mipha tangin cia hi. Mihing simin a kiliansakte kiniamsak tu a, a kiniamkhiakte a thupi in kikoi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in a nausente tungah Jesus ii a khut nga a thupha a piak tu in paipui uh hi. Nungzuite in hi bang a ngamtatnate mu in teih uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahihang Jesus in patangnote sam a, “Patangnote kei kungah hong pai tu khaam heak vun, banghang ziam cile Pathian Ngam sia hi bangte aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi thu ciamtee vun! Hi patangno khat bang a, Pathian Ngam a saang thei ngawlte tua ngam sungah a tum thei buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jew te lampui khat in, “Sya pha awng, tawntung nuntakna ka nga natu in bang ka vawt tu ziam,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Banghangin Sya pha hong ci ni ziam? Pathian khat simngawl kuama a pha om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thupiakte na heak hi: ‘Nupa kipalngul heak vun, mihing that heak vun; nguta heak vun; leilot thu taw kuama mawsak heak vun; na nu le na pa zakta vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasalpa in zo kik a, “Ka no lai panin hi thupiakte ka zui siat sa hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesus in hi thu a zaak ciangin ama tungah, “Na khat nasep tu kisamh lai ni hi. Na neisa teng zuakin a, na sum nga teng a zawngte pia in, tua hile vantung ah hauna na nei tu hi; tua zawkciangin hong pai ta'n a, ka nung hong zui ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahizong pasalpa in hi thu a zaak ciang khuangai mama hi; banghang ziam cile ama hau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesus in a khuangai mama na a mu ciangin, “Sumhaute ii Pathian Ngam sungah a tum tu bangza in haksa ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sumhau khat ii Pathian Ngamsung a tum tu sia, kalaoh khat ii phin bilvang sungah a tum tu sangin haksa zaw hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua thu a zate in, “Tua ahile akua peuma in ngupna nga zo thong tu ziam? ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesus in zo a, “Mihing atu a suak thei ngawlte Pathian atu in suak thei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Peter in, “En in! Ka inn uh nusia in nang kong zui uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah, “Hi hi, A maan tatak ka ci ciangin, Pathian Ngam atu in, inn ahizong, zi ahizong, suapuite ahizong, nu le pate ahizong, tate ahizong, a nusiate in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />hi hun sung mama ah, a tamzaw in nga tu a, hong pai lai tu hun sungah tawntung nuntakna nga tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesus in a nungzui sawm le niite sam tuam a, amate tungah, “Ngai vun. Mihing Tapa huvau kamsaangte ii at theampo a taangtun natu mun Jerusalem ah ih pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama Gentile te tungah hong ki aap tu a, amate in ciammuina in nei tu a, selno in cilphii tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in saat tu a thatlum tu hi, ahihang ni thum zawkciangin nuntakna sungah tho kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang hi thute khat zong nungzuite in a tel bua uh hi; tua kammalte ii khiakna sia amate mun panin kiseal a, Jesus in bang thu son ziam, ci in amate in a tel bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesus sia Jericho khua nai hong thet ciangin, lampi hui a mittaw khat khutdaw ngenin to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mihonte in kaantan in hong pai ama in a zaak ciangin, “Bang thu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Nazareth khua mi Jesus in hong kaantan hi,” amate in ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama au a, “David tapa Jesus awng! Kei hong hesuak ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mai a pai mihonpite in teih a, thim in sawl hi. Ahihang ama in a nging seseam in au a, “David tapa awng! Hong hesuak ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus tawlnga a, mittaw pa ama kungah hong paipui natu in thupia hi. Ama hong nai ciangin Jesus in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Nang atu bang hong vawtsak leng na uuk ziam?” ci hi. “Topa awng, khua ka mu kik nuam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesus in ama tungah, “Tua ahile khuamu ta'n! Na upna in hong damsak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thakhat thu in ama in khua hong mu thei a, Pathian tungah lungdamko in Jesus zui hi. Mihonpite in a mu ciangin Pathian pok tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in Jericho khua sungah tumin kaantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah shiadong pipa ahi sumhaupa Zacchaeus kici khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Jesus sia a koibang mi hi a, ci in mu nuam ahihang a tuntom khat ahikom mihonte hangin Jesus a mu thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite mai ah tai a, tua mun kaantan in hong pai tu Jesus mu nuamin theiteak kung khat tungah kaato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesus in tua mun a thet ciangin a tung ento in, “Zacchaeus awng, a manlangin hong tuaksuk ta'n, tuni in nangma inn ah hong taam tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zacchaeus hong tuaksuk paih a, lungdamna lianpi taw Jesus muak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A mu mihing theampo phun tek a, “Hisia pa in, mawneipa khat ii inn ah zintung thong hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zacchaeus ding a, Topa tungah hi bangin ci hi. “En in, Topa awng! Ka neisa a lang mizawngte ka pia tu hi; tuaciangin khat po ka theam ngei le a zaa li in ka lo kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesus in ama tungah, “Ngupna sia tuni in hi bangkua ah hong theng hi; banghang ziam cile hisia pa zongh Abraham ii suan khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing Tapa sia a bo a mangte zong tu le a ngum tu in hong pai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipite in hi thu ngai in a om laitakin, Jesus in thusonteena khat son thua hi. Ama tua laitakin, Jerusalem theng dektak zo ahikom mipite in Pathian Ngam hong kilangh pal tu hi vak ci in muangmaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in, “Khatvei lai in ulian khat sia ngam khualapi khat ah kumpi suak tu in pai a, tuasia zawkciang cia kik sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A vai din ma in a naseamte sawm sam a, khamh dangka khat tek pia in hi bangin ci hi. “Ka om ngawl sung teng in hisia taw bangza na meetsak thei uh ziam kisin vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in a ngammite in ama ensan uh a, kamtaite in delsak a, ‘Ko hisia pa ka kumpi tu in dei ngawl khu hi,’ cisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tua pa kumpi kisuaksak a, hong heak kik hi. Sum bangza tek meetsak ziam cisia a heak thei natu in, thakhat thu in a naseamte a mai ah samsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A masa in khat hong pai a, ‘Topa awng, nong aap khamh dangka khat ii tung panin, a dang sawm ka meetsak hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Pha mama hi. Nang in naseam pha khat na hi hi! Thunote tung zongh ah thumaan na hi ciang, khuapi sawm kong uksak tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A niina naseampa hong pai a, ‘Topa awng, kei khat nong piak sia ii tung pan khamh dangka nga ka meetsak hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hisia pa ii tungah, ‘Nang sia khuapi nga hong uksak tu khi hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naseam dang khat hong pai a, ‘Topa awng, hi lai ah na khamh dangka om hi, mainawlna puan sungah ka na phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang sia mihing haksa mama khat na hikom kong kiita hi; nangma neisa ahi ngawlte na la a, na poai ngawlna tung pan a at pa na hi hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Naseam taktai ngawlpa awng! Nangma kammal taw ma in, nangma hong kiman kik tu hi. Kei mihing haksa khat hi a, ka neisa ngawl bul la a, ka poai sa ngawl bul a atpa ka hi nong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahile banghangin ka sum sia dangka kholna zum ah koi ngawl ni ziam? Tua hile kong cia kik ciang a meet taw nga kik tu khi hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin a kungah a dingte munah, “A khamh dangka ama tung pan laaksak vun a, dangka sawm a nei naseampa pia vun,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang amate in, ‘Topa awng, ama in sawm nei zo hi,’ ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in zo kik a, ‘A tatakin ka ci ciangin, bang khat po a nei mihing sia ii tungah a tamzaw kipia tu hi; ahihang bangma a nei ngawl mihing khat ii tung panin a nei sun po kilaaksak lai tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu in a kumpipa tu in hong dei ngawl ka ngalte, hi munah hong paipui tavun a keima mai ah that vun,’ ci hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus in hi teng ci in Jerusalem zuan tu in amate mai ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Olive mual ah a om Bethphage khua le Bethany khua nai a thet ciangin, a nungzuite nii paisak khol a, hi bangin thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Na mai ah a om khua ah pai tavun. Khua sung na tum uh ciang, bangma hunin a tungah a kito ngeingawl lai laano khat kikhit in a om na mu tu uh hi. Hong suut tavun a, hi sungah hong paipui tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khat po in banghangin suut nu ziam ci in hong dongh le Topa in tulmaw hi ci vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate a pai uh ciangin na theampo Jesus ii son bangin a om mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in laano ii khau a suut ciangin, a neipa in, “Banghangin suut nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Topa in tulmaw hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in laano Jesus kungah paipui hi. Tua zawkciangin amate in a laktong puasilh suut a, laano tungah dapin, Jesus suanhto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Laano tungah to in a pai ciangin, mihonpite in a laktong puasilh uh lampi tungah pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama Jerusalem nai ah hong thet ciang Olive Mual sang paisukna munah, ama nungzui mihonpite in nalamdangte a mu hu in, awnging tak taw lungdamko in, Pathian pok uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Topa min taw hong pai Kumpipa tungah Pathian in thupha pia tahen! Vantung ah thinnopna om tahen a, Pathian minthang tahen!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin mihon sung a kihel Pharisee mi pawlkhat in Jesus tungah, “Sya awng, na nungzuite a thim natu in sawl in!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesus in “A tatakin ka ci ciang, amate in a thim uh le, suangtumte mama in au tu in hong kipan tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama khuapi taw a kinai vaialna hong theng a, khuapi a mu ciangin kapin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Thinnopna om thei natu in tuni in bang kisamh ziam ci in he thei thong lete maw! Ahizong tua thu mu thei ngawl ni hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hun khat hong theng tu a, na ngalte in na kiimkot panin phung leecian bangin hong uumci tu a, hong khakcip in, mun theampo panin hong sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate in na khuapi lalthamsak tu a, na tate uh taw hong moncip siat tu hi; suangtum khat beak zongh a omna ngei ah hong om nawn buatu hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in no hong ngum tu in hong pai hunlam na phawk bua uh hi,” ci in kaamal lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus Biakinn sungah tum in sumzuakte not tu kipan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />hi bangin ci hi, “Laithiangtho sung a ki atna ah, Pathian in ‘Ka biakinn sia thungetna inn kici tu hi,’ ci hi. Ahihang note in ngutate bukna mun na suaksak uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ni simin Jesus in Biakinn sungah thuhil hi. Thiampi liante, Thukham hil syate, le mihon lampuite in ama thatlum nuam uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />ahihang, amate in tuabang a pian thei natu in, lampi a mu bua uh hi, banghang ziam cile mihonte in, kammal no khat zongh a zaak khial tu uh uuk ngawlin, ama pauna ngai top uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat Jesus in Biakinn sungah mihonpite Lungdamna Thu huvau hilna le thuhilna a nei laitakin, Thiampi liante, Thukham hil syate, le upate hong pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama munah, “Hi bangin na ngamtat thei natu in, bang thu nei ni ziam? Akua in tuabang thunei theina hong pia ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesus in, “Kei zongh thu khat kong dongh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />John ii tuiphum piak theina sia Pathian ii tung panin hong pai ziam maw mihing tung pan hong pai ziam, hong son tavun” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate sung teng kam kinial a, “Bang ci tu hi ziam? Pathian tung pan ci leang, ‘Tua ahile banghangin John um ngawl nu ziam?’ hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabang ci bua ii, ‘Mihing tung pan’ ci leang le, mihonpite in ei suangtum taw hong deanglum tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in John sia kamsaang khat hi ci in um uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom, “Koisung pan hong pai ziam ci he ngawl khu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah “Tua ahile kei zongh bang thuneina taw hi bangin ngamta khi ziam ci in kong son buatu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in mihonpite tungah hi thusonteena son hi. “Khatvei lai in, mihing khat in sapitkungte suan in, pawlkhat in saapsak a, khuangei ma inn nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sapit ngate law hun ciangin a silate khat paisak a, ama tel tu sapitte ngensak hi. Ahizong huan saapte in, a silapa vel a bangma pia ngawlin heak kiksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom sila dangkhat paisak kik hi; ahihang huan saapte in ama zongh vel a, maizum pia in, bangma ngawl taw heak kiksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin ama in sila thumna sia paisak hi; huan saapte in tua pa zongh liamsak in huang pua ah vawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin huan neipa in, “Bang law tu khi ziam? Ka it ka tapa paisak tong: tua hile amate in na thasia nanak tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang huan saapte in tua pa a mu ciang, khat le khat kikum a, “Hi sia huan neipa ii tapa hi. Thatlum tawng, tua hile a neisa teng ei aa suak tu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom sapithuan pua sangah ama not in thatlum uh hi. Jesus in hi bangin dongh hi, “Tua ci leang sapithuan neipa in huan saapte bang law tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in hong pai tu a, tua mihingte thatlum in, sapithuan sia ngualdang in saapthawsak tu hi,” ci hi. Mihonpi in hi thu a zaak uh ciangin, “Tuabang suak thei ngawl tu hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesus in amate en a, “Tua ahile hi laithiangtho in bang ci nuam ziam? Inn sate ii mannung ngawl hi ci a, a nil suangtum sia a thupibel suangtum suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua suang tungah a puk peuma a bek a bekin kikhen tu a, tuaciang in tua suang sia khat po ii tungah hong taaksuk le tua pa sia leivui bangin zaantham tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thukham hil syate le thiampi liante in tua munah Jesus mat sawm uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in, ama ii son thusonteena sia amate a cina ahi hunlam he uh hi. Ahizong amate in mihonpite kiita uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A mat thei natu hunpha zong uh hi. Thuneite le Rome ngamuk mangpa tungah Jesus a aap thei natu in, thinsung takpi taw thu dongh nuam bangin a kiheang tu mihing pawlkhat sumnguk pia in paisak a, Jesus aitaa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi thudawpkute in Jesus tungah, “Sya awng na paunate le na hilnate maan hi, ci in ka he uh hi. Milian mino na awlmawk bua a, Pathian ii mihingte atu, a deisak thumaan thute hil hi, ci in kong he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahile ei thukham in Rome Kumpilianpa tungah shia piak tu khaam ziam maw khaam ngawl ziam hong son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in amate thin kukal teng phawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ngunn dangka khat hong la tavun. Akua lim le min a tungah ki at ziam?” ci hi. “Kumpilianpa aa hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesus in “Pha hi, tua ahile Kumpilianpa ii neisa Kumpilianpa pia tavun a, Pathian neisa Pathian pia tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua mun mihonpite mai ah a mat thei natu thu mal khat zongh om ngawl ahikom amate thim khipkhep in om a, a zo kik nate lamdang sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciangin mithite tho kik nawn ngawl tu hi, a ci Sadducee te Jesus kungah hong pai a, hi bangin ci uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Sya awng, Moses in hi thukhamte ei atu in a at hi: ‘Mihing khat in ta nei ngawlin a thi le, tua pa ii suapuipa in, meingongnu teenpui in, mithipa ii ta tatak bangin, a kingaisun thei tu in, ta neipui tu hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khatvei lai in unau pa sali om hi: a ubel sia in zi nei a, ta nei ngawlin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a niina sia in a numei sia teenpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin a thumna sia zongh tuabang ma ahi hi. A unau sali bupin, tuabang ma hi siat hi — ta nei ngawlin thi siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A khakbel in numeinu zongh thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu in mithite nungta tu in hong thaw kik ciangin numei sia akua ii zi hi tu ziam? Amate sali in teenpui tek hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesus in, “Tu hunin numeite le pate kiteang hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ahihang thina pan tho kikin, a nungta tu a kilawmte, hong pai pheang tu hun sungah kiteenna om nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate vantunglalangte bang hi tu a, a thithei buatu uh hi. Amate Pathian ii tate a suak uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate thina panin tho kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A thite nuntakna sungah kitho kiksak tu hi, ci in Moses in thiangtho takin lak hi. Sawlpaang kuang thu huvau a sonna munah Topa sia ama in, Abraham ii Pathian, Isaac ii Pathian, le Jacob ii Pathian,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama sia a nungtate Pathian hi a, a thisate Pathian hi ngawl hi banghang ziam cile ama atu in mihing theampo nungta hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thukham hil syate pawlkhat in, “Na zo kikna pha mama hi, Sya awng!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate in bangma a dongh ngam nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesus in, “Bangbangin Messiah sia David ii suan hi tu hi kici thei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile David ama mama in Psalm thubu sungah, “Topa in ka Topa ii tungah: Hi sung ka ziatsang ah hong to tan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />na ngalte na peang nuai ah ka koi dong” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“David in ‘Topa’ ci hi; tua ahile bangbangin Messiah sia David ii suan hi thei tu ziam,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mihing theampo in ama thu a ngai laitakin, a nungzuite munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Thukham hil syate panin kikeam tavun, amate puantual silh in, vak nuam a, vanhzuakna munah ngual ii zatak tu thangai hi; amate in synagogue te sungah a kikhaam kholsa tona ah to tha nuam uh a, anneak poaite ah mun phabelna ah to nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amate in meingongte zothaw uh a, a inn a lo suttol in, tuaciang, ngual ii pha a sak tu a deina in, a sau tatak thungen uh hi! Amate ii daan thuak tu sia nasia seseam tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus in a kiim a et ciangin Biakinn sum kholna sungah sumhaute ii sumpi khiak a mu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang a zawng mama meingongnu khat ii dangkasan pheak nii a khiak zongh mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “A tatak kong ci ciang, hi a zawng meingongnu in ngual dang theampo sangin tamzaw khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a dangte in a nei vaal uh khia a, ahihang nupinu in zawng mama hikale a nuntakna tu teng theampo pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nungzuite pawlkhat in, “Biakinn sia, a suangmanphate taw ahizong, Pathian tungah biakpiakna vanhte taw ahizong bangzata in etlawm ziam,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hite theampo na mu uh hi — suangtum khat zongh ama omna munah a om nawn ngawl hun khat hong theng tu hi; suangtum khat sim kilawn suk tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in, “Syapa awng, hi thu bang hun ciang hong piang tu ziam? Hi thu hong pian ciangin bang lim teng taw hong kilak tu ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesus in, “Kinging ta khol vun, ngual in theamsak heak vun. Mihing tam mamate in kei min taw hong pai tu a, ‘Kei in ama ka hi hi! A hun hong theng zo hi!’ hong ci tu hi. Ahihang amate ii nung na zui heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngal thu le tualngal thu na zaak uh hangin lau heak vun. Tuabangte hong piang phot tu hi. Ahizong hun bo natu hong nai zo cina hi ngawl lai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thuson zomto a, “Ngam khat le ngam khat kido tu a, kumpi khat le khat kisim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lauhuai zinliinna, kialpi tunna, pulpi tunna sia mun theampo ah om tu a, a lamdang a lauhuai nate van panin piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong, hi thute theampo a pian ma in, note hong kiman tu a, hong kivawtsia tu hi; synagogue te ah thu kisit tu in, hong ki aap tu a, tuaciang thong sungah hong kikhum tu hi; keima hu in no sia kumpite le ngamukte mai ah hong kithen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi hun sia no atu in Lungdamna Thupha na son thei natu hunpha hong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />No le no na kidal natu, na thinngim ngawl natu in a hun hong tun ma in, na thin uh khensat khol tavun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />banghang ziam cile na ngalte ii hong nial thei ngawl natu le hong nalh thei ngawl natu in, kammalte le ciimnate kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />No sia na nu na pate, na suapui pate, na mealheakte le na ngualtamhte in hong aap tu a, note pawlkhat thina na thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei hu in no sia mihing theampo in hong ensan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang na lu tung pan samzam khat zong a sumsi buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kip takin ding vun, tuasia ciang noma le noma na kingum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Jerusalem sia ngalkaphonpite in hong kim uum na mu uh ciang, tua khuapi lalthap natu nai hi, ci in na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun ciangin Judea ngam a omte in, mualtung tu in tai tahen; khuapi sung a omte in khua a nusiat uh kul tu a, ngamsung a omte in khuapi sung zuan heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile tua hun “Daan piak hun” a kici Laithiangtho ii son sia a tun natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin, naungaite le nau noailuai neite atu in bangza in haksa tu ziam! Hi ngam ah a kiitakhuai mama ngimna tung tu a, hi mihingte tungah Pathian daan tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawlkhat namsau taw kithat tu a, a dangte ngam theampo ah thongtaak tu in kipaipui tu hi; tuaciangin amate ii hun a cin mateng in Gentile te in Jerusalem sia a peang taw tuanhcil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ni le tha le aksite tungah nalamdangte piang tu hi. Leitung ngam bupte sungah thin lalna om tu a, tuipi tuihawkte le tui kihualte kiita tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leitung ah bang teng tak hong piang ziam ci in a ngak mihingte in launa taw butthi tu hi, banghang ziam cile vantung a om nate sia amate ii zin tek panin pial mang siat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaciang Mihing Tapa hong kilangh tu a, vaangletna le minthanna taw meeikaai sungah hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thute piang tu in hong kipat ciangin, dingto vun a, vandak vun, banghang ziam cile hong kingup tu hun hong nai zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesus in hi thusonteena, amate tungah son hi. “Theikung le thingkung dangte ngaisun vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuate ii teenote hong suak na mu uh ciang, khuakhaal hun hong nai zo hi, ci in na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in hi nalamdangte na mu uh ciang, Pathian Ngam hong theng dektak hi, ci in na he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tu laitak a nungta teng ii thi siat ma in, hi thute hong piang tu hi, ci in ciamtee tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Van le lei zongh hong bo tu hi, ahizong ka kammalte bo thong ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na kidawm tavun, no sia a vaalkaai neakna dawnnate le leitung nuntak natu thinngimnate taw na hun uh na bosak heak vun, ahibuale tua Ni sia in nang sia thakhat thu in thaang sungah mat bangin na awk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, leitung mun theampo ah mihingte tungah tua thusia hong tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hong piang tu hi thute pan suatakna taw na kaantan zawk natu uh le, Mihing Tapa mai ah na din natu in, thahatna na nei natu kinging kholsa in, om in thungen tawntung tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua hunsung Jesus in ni simin Biakinn sungah thuhilna hun zangh a, zan hun ahile Olive Mual tungah zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zing tuungin mihing theampo in ama ii hilna ngai tu in Biakinn ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paisan poai a kici Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poai nai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thiampi liante le Thukham hil syate in mipite kiita ahikom a thimtham in Jesus a suamlup thei natu lampi zon tu hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia laitakin nungzuite sawm le nii sung pan khat ahi Iscariot kici Judas ii sungah Satan tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom Judas pusuak a, Thiampi liante le Biakinn a cing Uliante munah Jesus a leeheak thei natu thute kikuppui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate lungdam a, sumpiak tu thukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a lungkim a, mipite heak ngawl laanin, Jesus amate khut sungah a aap thei natu hunpha zong tu in, kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Paisan Poai an tu in tuuno a kingaw ni, Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poai Ni hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesus in Peter le John sia hi bangin kam vaitha a paisak hi: “Pai tavun a, Paisan Poai an ih neak tu in vawtkhol tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Koi sungah vawtkhol le ung nong oai ziam,” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in zo kik a, “Khuapi sungah na tum uh ciangin, tuibeal khat a pua pasal khat in hong muak tu hi. Ama tumna inn ah zui tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaciang innteakpa munah ka nungzuite taw Paisan Poai an ka neak natu inn doituam sia koisung ziam ci in Syapa in hong donghsak hi,” ci tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in anneak thei natu a kisamh theampo taw a vawtkhol sa inn doituam lian, inn tung dawl hong lak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate a pai uh ciangin, na theampo Jesus ii son bang tatak ma in a om mu a, Paisan Poai an tu vawtkhol uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hun hong cin ciangin Jesus in Sawltakte taw sabuai ah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Thalup ka thuak ma in, no taw hi Paisan Poai an neakkhop tu ka uuk mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a tatakin ka ci ciang, Pathian Ngam sungah, hi neakna dawnna ii khiakna a kikhuangkhim mateng in hi an ka ne nawn buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Jesus in hai la a, Pathian pokin hi bang ci hi. Hisia la vun a, no sungah hawm tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A maan tak kong ci ciangin Pathian Ngam hong thet mateng in hi sapittui ka dawn nawn buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin anluum bekno khat la a, Pathian pokin, a balneen zawkciang amate pia a, hi bangin ci hi. “Hisia no atu hong kipia ka pumpi ahi hi. Kei nong phawna in, hi bang na vawt vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia bangma nitak anneak zawkciang, amate hai pia a, hi bangin ci hi. “Hi hai sia Pathian thuciamna thak no atu a hong kibua ka chi taw, a kikipsak sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong en vun! Kei hong leeheak tu pa sia hi sabuai ah kei taw ankuang um khawm hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian khensatna sa om bangin, Mihing Tapa sia thi tu hi, ahihang tuabang a ama a leeheak pa atu in, bangza in lauhuai ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciangin amate sung teng ah tuabang a ngamta tu sia akua hi ziam ci in kidongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nungzuite sungah thu kinialna khat piang a, amate sungah akua lianbel in kingaisun tu ziam, ci thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah “Doai biate ii kumpite in a mite tungah vaang nei a, ngamukte sia ‘Mihingte ii Lawmte hi’ kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang no sia tuabang na hi buatu uh hi; bangbang hi zaw tu nu ziam cile, a lianbel sia in a nobel bangin na om tu uh a, a lampui sia in naseam bangin na om tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An ne tu in a to pa lianzaw ziam maw ankuang a lui pa lianzaw ziam? A to pa lianzaw hi. Ahizong in note sungah kei sia ankuang a lui pa bangin kong om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Haksatna ka thuak lai theampo in, kei nong ompui uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ka Pa in ukna za hong piak bangma in no zong kong pia tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ka ngamsung ka sabuai ah no sia kei taw anne tuidawn khawm in, na om tu uh a, kumpi tokhum tungah to in, Israel minam sawm le niite na uk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Simon, Simon awng! Ngai in! Lothopa ii zungtaang le taangphawte a khen bangma in, a phate le a siate hong khen natu in, Satan in no theampo hong ze et natu thu nga zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahihang, Simon awng, na upna a lal ngawl natu in, thu kong ngetsak hi. Tuaciang kei sangah nong kiheak kik ciangin na suapuite a tha khosak tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Peter in zo a, “Topa nang taw thongtaak khawm tu le, a thi khawm tu in, ka kinging zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesus in, “Peter awng, a maan takin kong ci ciangin, ama ka he ngei bua hi ci in thumvei nong nial mateng, tu zanin ak khuang ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jesu in nungzuite munah, “Sumbawm, thung le peang dapte, ngawl taw kong paisak hunlai in, kitaangsapna na nei ngei uh ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Bangma kitaangsap nei ngei bua ung,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Ahizong tu in ahile, sumbawm ahibuale thungte a nei po in, keng tahen; namsau a nei ngawl peuma in a laktong puasilh zuak tahen a, lei tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a maan takin kong ci ciang, ‘Ama thukham paltan a, a mawte bangin, kithuaksak tu hi,’ ci a laithiangtho sungah kei ii thu a ki at teng taangtung tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nungzuite in, “En in! Topa awng, hi sungah namsau nii om hi!” ci uh hi. Ama in zo kik a, “Tu za pha zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesus in khuapi nusia in, a tawntung a pai ngei bangma in, Olive Mual ah pai a, nungzuite zongh ama taw pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua mun a thet ciangin amate tungah hi bangin ci hi, “Ze etna sungah na puk ngawl natu in, thu ngen tavun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate kung panin, muiden khat tan bang a khuala na ah pai lai a, khupdin in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Pa awng, nang deina ahile hi thuakna hai sia kei kung pan hong laksak ta'n. Ahizong kei deina bang hi ngawlin, nang deina bang hi tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaciang vantung pan in, vantunglalang khat kilangh a, ama tha khosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thinngimna lianpi taw nasia seseam in thungen hi; a khua ulsa chimal bangin lei ah taak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thungetna pan dingto a, a nungzuite kungah a pai ciangin, amate a khuangai lei hu in, ngimin mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ama in, “Banghangin mu nu ziam? Ze etna sungah na puk ngawl natu in, tho vun a thungen vun,” amate munah ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jesus in thu a son saan laitakin, nungzui sawm le niite sung pan khat ahi Judas lampui in mihonpi khat hong theng hi. Ama in Jesus namh tu in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in, “Judas awng, Mihing Tapa sia kinapna taw leeheak na hi ziam,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesus taw a omkhawm a nungzuite in bang teng hong piang tu ci in a mu uh ciang, “Topa awng, ka namsaute ka zangh tu uh ziam,” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Amate sung pan khat in Thiampi Lianbelpa ii sila pa bil ziatsang satansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus in, “Tu teng pha zo hi!” ci in a bil thamin damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesus in thiampi liante Biakinn cing uliante le upate ama man tu in, hong paite tungah, “Mihing that taiku khat man tu bangin namsau le moltawng taw hong kuan nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Biakinn sungah ni simin no taw kong om a, ahizong kuama in mat nong sawm bua uh hi. Ahihang tu laitak sia khuazing vaangletna ii uk hun laitak hi a, na dian tu uh hun ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Amate in Jesus man a Thiampi Lianbelpa inn ah paipui hi; tuaciang a nungsang a khuala thithimna pan Peter in zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Leitual laizang ah meiphual khat kithut a, mei kiim ah a tote kawm ah Peter zongh to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tuabangin mei oai a om a mu ciangin, naseam numei khat in, a mai salh in en a, “Hisia pa zongh Jesus taw kithawl hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ahihang Peter in nial a, “Numei awng, kei ama ka he ngei bua hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang pasal khat in Peter mu a, “Nang zongh amate sung pan khat na hi hi!” ci hi. Ahihang Peter in, “Pasal pa awng, hi ngawl khi hi!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Nai khat bang zawkciangin, pasal dangkhat ma in, nasia takin ci hamtang a, “Hisia pa, Jesus taw a kithawl hunlam up laak om bo, banghang ziam cile ama zongh Galilee mi khat ahi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ahihang Peter in, “Pasal pa awng, na son sia hong heakpui ngawl khi hi!” ci in zo kik hi. Tuabang a papau laitakin thakhat thu in ak hong khuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Topa hong ngeilee a, Peter a tangtan in en hi, tuaciang Peter in Topa ii ama tungah a sonsa sia phawk hi. “Tu zan ak khuan ma in, nang kong he bua hi, thum veina ci tu hi,” ci a, a sonsa sia phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Peter pusuak in nasia takin kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Jesus a cing mite in ama selno in vel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Amate in a mit tuamsak a, “Akua in hong saat ziam, son in!” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuaciangin kamsia nawno taw a nanam in selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Khuavak ciangin, amate thiampi liante le thukham hil syate kisitua uh a, tuaciang Jesus sia Council te mai ah paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />“Nang, Messiah na hi ziam? hong son ta'n,” ci uh hi. Ama in zo a, “Hong son leng hong um ngawl tu nu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />tuaciang thu hong dongh leng hong zo ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Ahihang tu pan kipan Mihing Tapa sia Vaanglianbel Pathianziatsang ah hong to tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Amate theampo in, “Tua ahile nang sia Pathian Tapa na hi ziam?” ci hon uh hi. Ama in “Noma ci bang ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in, “Tetti dang kul nawn bo! Ama kammalte ih zaak tek hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kikhawm theampo hong ding a, Pilate mai ah Jesus paipui uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua munah amate in hi bangin mawsiat uh hi: “Hisia pa in, ka minamte lampui khial in, Kumpilianpa zongh shia piak ngawl natu in, mihingte hol in, ama le ama Messiah kumpipa ka hi hi a ci laitakin ka man uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Nang sia Jew te ii Kumpipa na hi ziam?” ci in Pilate in dongh hi. “Nangma ci bang ahi hi,” ci in Jesus in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Pilate in thiampi liante le mihonte tungah “Hisia pa mawsak natu thu bangma mu ngawl khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang amate in nasia seseam in mawsak uh a, “A thuhilna taw Judea ngam bup mite buaisak tu in, kipan hi. Galilee ngam panin hong kipan a, tu in hi sung hong theng hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pilate in hi thu a zaak ciangin, “Hi pa Galilee mi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Jesus sia Herod ii ukna ngammi khat hi, ci in a tel ciang Jerusalem ah tua hun laitak hong om Herod kungah puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Herod in Jesus a mu ciangin, a lungdam mama hi, banghang ziam cile ama thu za ngei zo a, a mu nop zawk khuangei zo hi. Jesus in nalamdang lakna pawlkhat vawt tu in Herod in muangmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Herod in Jesus thu tam mama dongh a, ahihang Jesus in a zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thiampi liante le thukham hil syate mai sangah pai a, nasia takin Jesus mawsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Herod le a ngalkapte in Jesus etsatna taw selno hi; tua zawkciang puantual pha khat silhsak in, Pilate kungah puak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni mama in Herod le Pilate ngualtamh suak uh hi; tua masia hun ahile amate kingal vilvel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilate in Thiampi liante, lampuite le mihonte sam a, amate munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hisia pa in, mihingte lampui khial hi, ci in nong paipui uh hi. Tu in noma mai ah thu ka sit ciangin na mawsak nop uh mawnate khat zongh ama in vawt ngawl hi, ci in ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dom ngawlin Herod zongh in, a maw na tu a mu zawk ngawl hu in, hong puak kik hi. Hisia pa in thina thuakna tu taw kilawm ngamtatna bangma a vawt bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama ka saatsak zawkciang, ka tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Paisan Poai om simin, Pilate in thongtaakte khat veu amate atu in a suataksak a ngeina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihon bup in, “Ama that in! Barabbas sia koma atu in suaktasak in!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Barabbas sia khuapi sungah buaina khat a om hu le, mihing thalupna thu khat hu in, thong kitaaksak ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pilate in Jesus suatak nuam a, tua hu in mihonte tungah son kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang amate in ausan kik a, “Thinglamtee tungah thatlum in! Thinglamtee tungah thatlum in!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilate in a thum veina hi bangin ci hi. “Ahihang ama in bang khialna vawt ziam? Thina thuakna tu za dong ngamtatna a vawt bangma ka mu bua hi! Tua ahikom ama ka saat tu a, tua zawkciang ka tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jesus sia thinglamtee tungah thalup natu in, amate in tawlnga ngawlin au uh a, a khakbel ciangin amate auna in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pilate in amate ii nget thidaan sia Jesus tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Buaina hu le mihing thalupna hang a, thong a kitaaksak, amate ii dei sia pa suaktasak a, tuaciang a uuk babang a vawt tu in, amate tungah Jesus aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngalkapte in Jesus paipui uh a, tuabang a pai laitakin, ngamsung pan khuapi sungah hong pai Simon a kici Cyrene khua mipa taw kisi uh hi. Amate in tuasia pa man a, thinglamtee suan in Jesus nungzui in puasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihonpi khat in ama zui a, tuate sungah numei pawlkhat in ama kaa a, mau in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jesus in amate sang nga in, “Jerusalem numeite awng! Kei atu in kap heak vun, noma atu le na tate atu in kap po vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, ‘Numei ta nei thei ngawlte le nau noailuai a nei ngeingawlte bangza in hampha ziam?’ a kici hunte hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua hun sia mihingte ii, mualpite tungah, ‘Ko tungah hong cim tavun!’ mualnote tungah, ‘Hong seal tavun!’ a kici hun hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a thingkung sia a hin lai in, hi bangin kivawt ahile, a ko ciang bang suak tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A dang phalakte nii zong Jesus taw kithat tu in, paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate “LUNGU” a kici na mun a thet ciangin, tua munah Jesus sia thinglamtee tungah kilh uh a, phalakte nii zongh a ziatsang ah khat, a veisang ah khat kilh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesus in “Pa awng, amate mawna maisak in! Amate in bang vawt uh ci zongh a tel bua uh hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang amate in nuangtang lotna taw ama puante hawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesus sia lampuite in ciammuina in nei uh a, “Ngualdang zongh hun thei hi; Pathian ii teal Messiah ahile ama le ama kihun ve hen!” a ci uh laitakin mihonte in, dingin en hon uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ngalkapte zongh in, selno uh hi: amate in ama kungah kaato uh a, sapittui haau pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Jew te kumpipa na hile nangma le nangma kisuaktasak in,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama ii tungah, “Hisia in Jew te ii Kumpipa ahi hi,” ci in ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama taw a kikhaikhawm phalakpa khat in selno hi. “Nang Messiah hi ngawl ni ziam? Nangma le nangma kisuaktasak in a, ko zong hong suaktasak ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahihang phalak dangkhat pa in, ama teih a, “Pathian kiita ngawl ni ziam? Nang in ama bangma in daan na thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahihang ei ih hile ih ngamtatna taw a kiphu tu in, ih thuak ahiciang ahi tu ma hi; ahihang ama in khialna bangma vawt ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in Jesus munah, “Jesus awng, Kumpi in nong pai ciangin, kei hong phawk ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesus in ama munah, “A maan tak kong ci ciang, tuni in nang sia keima taw Paradise ah na om tu hi, ci in kong kamciam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sun nai sawm le nai nii hun bang ciangin ni taang nawn ngawl a, nitak nai thum dong ngamsung buppi khuazing hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />tuaciang Biakinn sungah inndoi doina puankhai sia khen nii kisua in, kizentham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jesus in nging takin hi bang hong au hi, “Pa awng! Na khut sungah ka thaa kong aap hi!” a ci zawkciang ama thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ngalkap hon ukpa in a piang thu teng mu a, ama in Pathian pok hi. “Ama sia mihing pha tatak khat hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A en tu kikhawm mipite in, a piang sa thu teng a mu zawk uh ciangin, inn ah cia in, hee leilam in a awm beang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Jesus taw a kihe theampo le Galilee ngam pan ama a zui numeite in, ngal et uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Judea ngam Arimathea khua mi Joseph kici khat om hi. Ama a zatakhuai mihing pha khat hi a, Pathian Ngam hong thet tu a ngakpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama Council Upa khat ahihang, a lawmte ii thukhenna le, ngamtatnate a thukim bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ama in Pilate omna ah pai in, Jesus luanghawm ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciangin, a luang khiasuk a, puankaang neal khat taw a tun zawkciang, kuama kisial ngeingawlna, a kikhuak suanghawng thaan khat sungah sial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tua ni sia nipi zawk ni nga ni hi a, Sabbath ni hong theng dektak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Galilee ngam pan Jesus nung a zui numeite Joseph taw hong pai uh a, a thaan le Jesus luang kisialna mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin amate in a luang zut natu in, hel namtui le paaknamtuite vawtkhol tu in inn ah cia kik uh hi. Thukham om bangin amate Sabbath ni in tawlnga uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nipi ni zingsang tuungin, numeite thaan vil uh a, amate helkholsa sathau namtuite keng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thaan kongvang panin, suangtumpui sia a kiliik sa in mu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ahikom amate a sungah tum uh hi; ahihang amate in Topa Jesus luang a mu bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thu lamdang sa in, tua munah a din laitakin, thakhat thu in mihing nii, a taang mama puansilh in, amate kungah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numeite lau mama in, a kun uh ciangin, tua mihingte nii in, “A thisate ii omna munah, banghangin a nungta khat hong zong nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama hi sungah om ngawl hi; ama kitho kiksak zo hi. Galilee aa a om lai, no tung a hong thusonte phawk kik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa sia mawneite khut sungah ki aap in, thinglamtee tungah kithat tu a, a ni thum zawkciangin nuntakna sungah hong thoto kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin numeite in a kammalte phawk kikin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thaan pan heak kik a, hi thute theampo nungzui sawm le khat te le, a dangte tungah son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua numeite Mary Magdalene, Joanna, le James ii nu Mary hi a; amate teng le a dang numeite in hi thu teng sawltakte tungah son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang sawltakte in, numeite ii thuson sia luithawthong hi tu in, ngaisun uh a, a um bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong Peter ding a, thaan sangah hong tai in; kunsuk in a et ciangin, thaan puan simngawl bangma dang a mu bua hi. Tuaciang in thupiangte huvau tumdang sa in, ama inn ah cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ni mama in Jesus nungzuite nii sia, Jerusalem pan tai sali a khualana Emmaus khuano ah pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang amate in tua hunsung thupiang teng kikum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabang a kikup laitakin, Jesus ama mama in, neak a, amate taw tonkhawm hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />amate in Jesus mu napi a tel bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah, “Lampai kawm in khat le khat bang thu son nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate maikhingin ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate ngeal sung panin Cleopas a kici pa in, “Jerusalem khual hong haw mihingte sung pan, tu sung teng a thupiangte a he ngawl sia nangma bekma hi thong ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“A bang thu ziam?” ci hi. “Nazareth mi Jesus tungah thupiangte hi,” ci in zo kik hi. “Hisia pa in, kamsaang khat hi a, ama sonte le sepna theampo vaang nei hi, ci in Pathian le mihing theampo ii ngaisut pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thiampi liante le ngamukte in thidaan thuak tu in aap uh a, tuaciang ama thinglamtee tungah kithat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel te suatak a pia tu pa hi tu hi ci in ka lam en uh hi! Tua banah hi thu hong pian zawk sia tu in a ni thum ni hi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Koma pawl sungah numei pawlkhat in hong liinglawngsak hi; amate khuavak bekin thaan vil uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahihang a luang a mu zo bua uh hi. Amate hong heak kikin, vantunglalangte a muna thu le ama sia nungta kik a hina thu son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka pawl uh sung pan aheap thaan ah pai uh a, numeite thuson bang tatakin om a mu uh hi; ahihang ama a mu bua uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesus in amate tungah “Bangza ta in mawmaw nu ziam? Kamsaangte son theampo bangza in um thei papaih ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Messiah in hite a thuak phot tu kul a, tua zawkciangin vaangletna sungah tum tu hi ngawl ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesus in ama huvau Moses ii laibute pan a kipan kamsaangte lai at theampo dong Laithiangtho a vekpi sungah a kison teng sonthiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A pai natu khuano sia a thet nai tu ciangin, Jesus in a paisuak tu bangin ki omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahihang amate in tho uh a, hi bangin ci uh hi. “Koma kungah hong taam ta'n, ni zong tum dektak zo a, khuazing tu hi,” ci uh hi. Tua ahikom amate kungah taam tu in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate taw an ne tu in to a, anluum la in thupha a piak zawkciangin, balneen in amate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin amate ii mit hong kihongin, ama tel uh a, ahihang amate kung panin ama bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate khat le khat hi bangin kici uh hi, “Lampi tungah Laithiangtho hong sonthiang laitakin ih thinsung meikuang taw hal bang hi kana ngawl ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate ding pai a, Jerusalem khua ah pai kikin, nungzui sawm le khat te le a dangte kikhawm a om a mu uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />hi bangin ci uh hi. “Topa tho takpi zo hi! Simon tungah kilak hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaciang amate nii in lampi tungah a piang thu le, anluum a balneen ciang, Topa ahi hunlam a telna uh bang teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mihing niite in hi thu teng a sawson laitakin, thakhat thu in Topa amate laizang ah ding a, “Thinnopna na nga tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thithaa khat mu kisa in amate patau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahihang ama in, “Banghangin patau nu ziam? Banghangin hi up laaknate na thinsung ah hong piang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka khut ka peang hong en tavun. Keima tatak ma ka hi hunlam hong en tavun. Hong tham tavun, banghang ziam cile thithaa in ngu le taang le samalte, tu a ka nei nong mu thei uh bangin a nei bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hi teng ci in amate a khutte le a peangte lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in a um thei bualai hi, banghang ziam cile, amate lungdamna le lamdangsakna taw kidim uh hi; tua ahikom ama in, “Neak tu khat po na nei uh ziam?” ci in ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in ngasa pumhuan bek khat pia uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />amate ii mu tangin la in ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in, “Note taw kong om lai a, kong sonsa thu teng veuma ahi hi: kei taw kisai a ki at, Moses thukhamte, kamsaangte lai atte, le Psalm te hong taangtun kul hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate Laithiangtho a tel natu in, ama in a thinsung uh honsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />tuaciang ama in amate tungah, “A ki at sia hisia hi: Messiah in thuak tu hi, a ni thum zawkciangin thina pan tho kik tu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />tuaciang ama min taw kisiik kikna le mawmaisakna sia Jerusalem pan kipan minam theampo tungah kihil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />No sia hi thute ii tetti na hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaciangin ka Pa ii hong kamciamsa sia noma sungah keima tatak ma in kong puak tu hi. Ahihang note in tungsang pan vaangletna note tungah hong thet dong khuapi sungah na ngak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in amate teng khuapi sung pan Bethany dong paipui a, tua munah khut laamin thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Thupha a piak laitakin, ama sia amate taw kikhen a, vantung ah kila to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Amate in, ama a biak zawk uh ciang, lungdamna lianpi taw kidim uh a, Jerusalem ah heak kik in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />a hun nei uh theampo Biakinn sung Pathian tungah lungdamkona in zangh uh hi.
  </para>
</usx>
